INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(185,'en','A well-carved staff, recommended for novices.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(188,'en','This staff increases wisdom. It has one awkward side effect... I''m sure you can guess.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(194,'en','This staff increases vitality and can be eaten if required.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(200,'en','The God Rod is a fearsome weapon. Warriors have been known to win battles in their sleep with the aid of this... fearsome weapon.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(201,'en','The Hook was found on a corpse, near a huge, decomposing Crocodyl.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(202,'en','The tears of the angel Raziel blessed this sword. Terribly destructive, it''s powerful enough to help you fend off the most fearsome of enemies.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(203,'en','If you ever work out how to get this incredible item round your waist, you''ll be one of the luckiest heroes in the universe. This belt once belonged to the strongest and most attractive of the bearded heroes of old.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(204,'en','This living Staff roamed the darkest corners of Amakna for ages. Now it sleeps deeply, only waking up every 300 years to move to a different place or to look for a different owner. It favours the stench of small, sweaty tunnels... Helps it sleep it says...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(205,'en','These well-forged daggers are recommended for beginners.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(206,'en','These well-forged daggers are recommended for beginners.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(207,'en','These well-forged daggers are recommended for beginners.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(208,'en','These well-forged daggers are recommended for beginners.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(211,'en','These well-forged daggers will make a worthy adversary of you.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(212,'en','These well-forged daggers will make a worthy adversary of you.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(213,'en','These well-forged daggers will make a worthy adversary of you.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(214,'en','These well-forged daggers will make a worthy adversary of you.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(218,'en','Bashers are formidable daggers favoured by assassins who must dispatch the most bloodthirsty of warriors.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(219,'en','These Blessdags once belonged to the renowned Ogre ''Dark Hand'' who died while fighting a Bimd''Oole paladin. Apparently, his blood animates these sick knives.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(220,'en','The Chakra Style... a pair of daggers that once belonged to the greatest female thief of all time. Chakra was the first to open the doors of the Osaroth Temple and steal the precious relics hidden there.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(221,'en','A well-forged hammer, recommended for beginners.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(222,'en','A well-forged hammer, recommended for beginners.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(223,'en','A well-forged hammer, recommended for beginners.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(224,'en','A well-forged hammer, recommended for beginners.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(227,'en','This hammer increases intelligence.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(228,'en','This hammer increases intelligence.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(229,'en','This hammer increases intelligence.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(230,'en','This hammer increases intelligence.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(233,'en','Kaiser was the name of the dastardly Dragon Pig who destroyed Bounkaïda Village many years ago. When the militia got the better of this monster, the smiths used the remains of Kaiser to make weapons. This Hammer is one of them.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(234,'en','The Ragnarok is powerful enough to raise a storm. It can also raise the temper of your friends if you don''t know how to use it properly.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(235,'en','This hammer once belonged to the guardian of the Door of Hell. He prevented the living from coming in, the dead from going out and the living dead from urinating through the letterbox. Dirty monkeys!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(236,'en','The Barabas is a fearsome weapon: it allows its wearer to move with stealth and ease and most importantly, to become more deadly in close combat.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(237,'en','Sargasse once belonged to a child with fearsome powers. No one has seen it since it was reportedly traded for a bag of marbles.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(238,'en','A well-balanced shovel, recommended for beginners.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(239,'en','A well-balanced shovel, recommended for beginners.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(240,'en','A well-balanced shovel, recommended for beginners.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(241,'en','A well-balanced shovel, recommended for beginners.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(244,'en','An extremely well-forged shovel, this tool will make a worthy adversary of you.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(245,'en','An extremely well-forged shovel, this tool will make a worthy adversary of you.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(246,'en','An extremely well-forged shovel, this tool will make a worthy adversary of you.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(247,'en','An extremely well-forged shovel, this tool will make a worthy adversary of you.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(250,'en','Halfway between an axe and a shovel, Axel was one of the seven weapons used by the demon Kajlir to overcome the Brotherhood of the Enutrofs, vicious adventurers searching for the Crimson Dofus.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(251,'en','Greybeard was the favourite weapon of the demon-dwarf Assan Cehef who terrorised countless villages with his surprise attacks.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(252,'en','This belt increases life... You''re more likely to get through a fight that way.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(253,'en','This belt increases life... You''re more likely to get through a fight that way.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(254,'en','This belt increases life... You''re more likely to get through a fight that way.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(255,'en','This belt increases life... You''re more likely to get through a fight that way.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(256,'en','This belt increases its wearer''s strength.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(257,'en','This belt increases its wearer''s strength.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(258,'en','This belt increases its wearer''s strength.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(259,'en','This belt increases its wearer''s strength.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(260,'en','This belt increases its wearer''s agility.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(261,'en','This belt increases its wearer''s agility.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(262,'en','This belt increases its wearer''s agility.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(263,'en','This belt increases its wearer''s agility.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(264,'en','The Disconcerting Bow is not new by any means, but it can be very useful.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(265,'en','The Disconcerting Bow is not new by any means, but it can be very useful.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(266,'en','The Disconcerting Bow is not new by any means, but it can be very useful.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(267,'en','The Disconcerting Bow is not new by any means, but it can be very useful.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(270,'en','The Xaver is an efficient bow. It once belonged to the Great Baker Xavier. Between two batches, he used it to distribute bread to the monsters around his bakery.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(271,'en','A beautiful, strange and fascinating weapon, you''ll get nice and close to your enemy with this hammer... That''s the way Chafers like it!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(272,'en','This bow is powerful enough to shoot an arrow to the moon. This activity had to be banned for obvious reasons, but it is nice to know.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(273,'en','The Yamato String has thrilled many a monster''s heart. It''s a fine weapon, able to send an arrow flying to the most oblique spots.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(278,'en','A ring set with a rare stone. Do I need to explain the name?');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(279,'en','If we are to believe one renowned adventurer, this amulet contains the tear of a Gobball, which has the same properties and stench as Gobball leather tea.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(280,'en','Collectors prize this necklace, you will certainly get a good price for it.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(293,'en','The only thing as solid as a Crackler is a Crackler, that''s why this Crackler hunting shovel is made of Crackler Stone.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(294,'en','The only thing as solid as a Crackler is a Crackler, that''s why this Crackler hunting shovel is made of Crackler Stone.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(295,'en','The only thing as solid as a Crackler is a Crackler, that''s why this Crackler hunting shovel is made of Crackler Stone.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(296,'en','The only thing as solid as a Crackler is a Crackler, that''s why this Crackler hunting shovel is made of Crackler Stone.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(297,'en','These boots are made of Gobball leather. Thanks to the smell they give off, breeders can approach and kill other Gobballs with the slightest of ease.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(298,'en','These sandals are made from the feathers of boiled Tofu and the sole from Tofu beak, a very resistant material. Protracted wearing can render the wearer as daft as a Tofu.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(299,'en','Offence is the best defence. With these anti-aggression boots, you will easily send muggers packing. And those guys who come up to you at crossroads and clean your mount''s teeth.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(317,'en','This staff used to be very handy for Amakna breeders who wanted to keep their flocks of Tabis in one place. It doesn''t actually do much, but it is very light. Great for running after Gobballs.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(318,'en','This staff used to be very handy for Amakna breeders who wanted to keep their flocks of Tabis in one place. It doesn''t actually do much, but it is very light. Great for running after Gobballs.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(319,'en','This staff used to be very handy for Amakna breeders who wanted to keep their flocks of Tabis in one place. It doesn''t actually do much, but it is very light. Great for running after Gobballs.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(320,'en','This staff used to be very handy for Amakna breeders who wanted to keep their flocks of Tabis in one place. It doesn''t actually do much, but it is very light. Great for running after Gobballs.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(323,'en','This amulet gives the wearer special abilities: they will be possessed by a mysterious aura, which flows through their bodies and increases their physical abilities tenfold.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(324,'en','This amulet turns pink when you''re feeling perky. Rumour has it that it also increases tenfold your chances of finding good items.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(325,'en','Hand-made by one of the greatest Sram jewellers, this amulet is made of small skulls carved in bone, helping its wearer escape perilous situations.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(326,'en','The Deulegarnoulle amulet comes from the Nordic regions... It''ll increase your summoning powers.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(327,'en','This blade was first forged for the Karne Riders, but it was unfortunately too heavy for those weak goblins. 
It''s a very light weapon for normal beings, however, light enough to deliver rapid blows in succession.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(328,'en','This strange double-bladed sword was originally used to prune trees and cut through dense forests. The lumberjacks soon realised that it was also an excellent weapon against other creatures.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(329,'en','As its name indicates, this bow will help you on your path to consistent victory. A skilled Cra architect without an ounce of imagination later stole the same name for one of his monuments.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(331,'en','This is the bow of choice in the region. From what people say, you''ll find treasure where its arrows fall. You have to make sure you fire them towards the end of a rainbow, but I still think it''s crazy.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(332,'en','Joan was a little crazy, always hearing Tabis burping she said... They confiscated her bow - for her own good, mind you - and finally decided to burn her at the stake altogether. She burnt great, she did, something else... And I''ve seen a few burnings, me... I still have her singed kneecap if you want... come... hey! Where... ahhhh!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(333,'en','Originally made to be eaten, this baguette became a fearsome weapon when Xavier the Baker left it in his furnace for 234 years. Why did leave it so long? He had enough of making cheese sandwiches, and started doling out knuckle sandwiches to the monsters around the bakery. In his enjoyment, he forgot all about it.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(334,'en','This wand once belonged to Lirel, an Eniripsa who died of an overdose of strawberries, after losing his wings in a pain so excruciating that your heart would stop beating if I told you any more. Collectors are surprisingly desperate to get hold of this wand, given that it''s said to be cursed.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(335,'en','Without their staff, the Magus Bworks are as harmless as Tofus. Need I say more about the power of this weapon?');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(336,'en','This staff can levitate Cawwots! Mind you, that''s not very useful in a fight, it has to be said.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(337,'en','The Bwork Archer Bow is extremely simple to use. It was designed with the Bwork Archers in mind... A bloody Tofu could use it... The catch is that you have to be as strong as a Crackler to string it.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(338,'en','This basic sword can usually be handled even by the most idiotic of Bworks, that is to say the ones who are incapable of using a bow or a staff... Some of these geniuses even mistake the blade for the handle. The tradition in this case is for the Bwork to poke its own eyes out with its fingers... Lovely!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(339,'en','This Blade once belonged to Metzger the Butcher, who used it to cut up bones. A Chafer managed to steal it from him and in his hands, the blade became a fearsome weapon. Whole families of shoe salesmen went out of business, not to mention the glove trade... just terrible.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(340,'en','These daggers allow you to steal anything and everything, anything from everyone, or everything from anyone, or everyone from any...no that doesn''t work... They''re great, though.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(341,'en','These legendary daggers are a true collector''s item for any self-respecting Sram. They are so revered that even some of these rats refuse to steal them.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(342,'en','This very special hammer was made of Kwak beaks. That''s why it''s so prickly when it knocks you head over heels!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(345,'en','An Enutrof builder who had had a few drinks too many at the tavern realised one night that this shovel could do more than dig holes in the ground.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(346,'en','According to some legends, this ring protects against bad weather. In reality, this has never been proven because it has never rained in Amakna.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(347,'en','This shovel is a very efficient tool for cutting nutsedge, a type of weed. It''s also an excellent weapon for taking care of the weeds you''ll find in the inns of Amakna.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(348,'en','These boots once belonged to a cook who was always in a big rush. He spent his time criss-crossing the land of Amakna looking for celery-tea.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(352,'en','A holy sword awarded to young warriors during their training.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(353,'en','The Little Knight Sword is an efficient and sturdy sword. Properly used, it can inflict serious damage upon your enemies.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(354,'en','This kind of sword is forged for the bodyguards of a renowned and wealthy shopkeeper. Its main use consists of frightening thieves but when murder is required - a tenacious burglar, a fussy customer - you''ll find it equal to the task.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(355,'en','This ring increases strength and courage.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(356,'en','This simple belt increases stamina.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(357,'en','This sword symbolizes a body part Ecaflips of which Ecaflips are particularly proud. If you don''t feel it''s hypocrisy to take it, be my guest.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(358,'en','The Infernal Tail is really... infernal. If you don''t use it properly, it will drive your enemies and team mates completely crazy... before long, you won''t have any team mates left, just enemies. Nobody has ever been known to use it properly, so, well, you''ve been warned.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(359,'en','A long time ago, King Allister Snoc gave this ring to Isidor, a smart cat, renowned for his incomparable agility.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(436,'en','This staff is carved out of a huge Treechnid root, and its main use is in close combat. The only problem for the owner is that its roots regenerate when in contact with water... That includes rain, by the way.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(454,'en','This perfectly-forged axe is the perfect gift for lumberjacks who always blame their tools.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(455,'en','This ridiculously small hammer was used by Zokrim the peasant. Every day at dawn, he would work on his useless, meandering fences which still stretch all over his territory like confused spider webs.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(456,'en','This axe enables you to easily cut down trees, even the biggest ones. It is above all appreciated for its heavy weight which can cut a Bwork into three pieces. The only requirement is that you are strong enough to lift it!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(458,'en','Some say the Chafer is sensitive and distinguished, because his amulet carries the skulls of his dead cousins. Others say he''s a beastly creature, because it was he who killed them.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(462,'en','Though you can kill the Treechnids, their wood never truly dies... this makes it incredibly difficult to work. All the same, killing a Treechnid with an arrow made of the root of one of its brothers will really hit hard, and if they don''t die, you can be sure it''ll ruin their lives forever! Good show!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(469,'en','This wand makes use of the magic properties of the Treechnid Root. Beware of the side effects of this living wand, it can sometimes turn against its owner.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(478,'en','This axe has Woodee The Lumberjane to thank for its name... She knew how to turn on the charm and divert the lumberjacks'' attention, running in and stealing all the best trees for herself while they scurried off to pay ridiculous prices for rosebuds, sugarcane and those little snow globes that you shake... as soppy as wells they were.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(482,'en','An Enutrof builder who had had a few drinks too many at the tavern realised one night that this shovel could do more than dig holes in the ground.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(483,'en','An Enutrof builder who had had a few drinks too many at the tavern realised one night that this shovel could do more than dig holes in the ground.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(484,'en','An Enutrof builder who had had a few drinks too many at the tavern realised one night that this shovel could do more than dig holes in the ground.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(491,'en','This item is essential to the work of Jewellers.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(493,'en','An essential tool for making hammers.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(494,'en','An essential tool for making swords.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(495,'en','An essential tool for making daggers.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(496,'en','An essential tool for making shovels.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(497,'en','An essential tool for collecting ore.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(498,'en','An essential tool for making staffs.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(499,'en','An essential tool for making wands.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(500,'en','An essential tool for making bows.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(502,'en','This axe is the only tool that can cut down enchanted trees. It''s the silver bullet of axes.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(515,'en','This axe once belonged to the renowned Lumberjack, Brouce Boulgoure. He used to be married to Kassiopee Baine, another great Lumberjack''s daughter. Many''s the time this weapon protected him when he was alone in the forest.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(577,'en','This scythe will never be a fearsome weapon, since it''s a bit rusty and not very sharp... On the other hand, it is the perfect tool for reaping grain.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(579,'en','An essential tool to the making of shoes and belts.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(592,'en','This bow once belonged to Ivan Nowe, a foolhardy Cra who had a cruel habit of attacking stray Tofus. This bow first puzzles the enemy before efficiently killing them.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(610,'en','This delicate but original whitish amulet is made of Crab.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(616,'en','This amulet, set with fish scales, is supposed to bring its wearer good luck when he puts out to sea on stormy nights.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(617,'en','Many sailors have been impressed by this terrifying amulet. All you have to do is put it on and you''ll be a feared warrior.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(619,'en','This staff allowed Paile Ingalsse, breeder of Gobballs, to summon the Tofus that kept his flocks safe. After a tragic accident, he discovered that it was also a fierce weapon.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(620,'en','Thanks to this sword, the celebrated sailor Mobby Diquerivurs sliced the tentacles off the equally famous Giant Kralove of Moon Island, much feared for his habit of smothering drunken sailors.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(629,'en','Your date will be the Queen of the Ball with this magnificent hat.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(638,'en','Fishing a Somoon is quite a miracle but don''t worry, with this amulet around your neck, there''s no such word as "can''t".');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(639,'en','The Amulet of the Depths has been found in the submerged shipwreck of the renowned Kralove fisherman, Tom Fawyer, also famous for his lousy jokes at the pirates'' bar.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(640,'en','Fishermen used this bow to clean the vermin off the coastlines of Amakna... The cowards usually committed the pesticide from the windows of the local bars.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(657,'en','This staff allowed Shika Ingalsse, leader of Gobballs, to summon the Tofus that kept her flocks safe. After a tragic accident, she discovered that it was also a fierce weapon.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(658,'en','This staff allowed Gramine Ingalsse, leader of Gobballs, to summon the Tofus that kept his flocks safe. After a tragic accident, he discovered that it was also a fierce weapon.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(673,'en','This Axe has no outstanding features except its natural lightness which is due to the Chestnut Wood it is made from. It has a shaft as light as a feather from the tail of a young Evil Tofu.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(674,'en','"There''s nothing wrong with this axe... Seriously, nothing. Really." The wise words of Brouce Boulgoure, Lumberjack extraordinaire. Its Cherry wood shaft cushions vibrations when you''re cutting trees down or splitting Bworks'' skulls.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(675,'en','This axe doesn''t look special, but it does the job. Brouce Boulgoure the Lumberjack won the Bwork Dwarf tree-cutting championship with this modest tool - that''s saying something.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(676,'en','This axe''s special feature is that it never gets rusty, so don''t be surprised when hungry Lumberjacks start licking the sweet tree sap from its blade.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(677,'en','This cloak once belonged to Zokrim, an old pirate. He must have been rather unlucky...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(694,'en','Ignemikhal the Fire Dragon created the Crimson Dofus. I would tell you that it stinks of sulphur... but it stinks of so many other things too.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(696,'en','Besides its has-been look, the Slob Headgear is great for those high-noon duels... keeps some sun out of your eyes.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(697,'en','Makroute is a very affectionate dog... He never leaves his master''s side. A fine animal.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(698,'en','The Sortingat Hogwat comes from a famous School of Magic. This lively creature has met the greatest wizards of our time, like Mrs Magoa AlaGale, Mr Doublegore and the renowned Misk''arry Rotter.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(699,'en','The Trauma is as shady as an Eraserhead made of Bherb hairs, and that''s saying something. (If you don''t know what an Eraserhead made of Bherb hairs looks like, refer to the great books of the Hen Pens).');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(700,'en','Ah, the Pandawa, look at the face on him! Just like his good friend Makroute, he spends all his time on his owner''s head. This lazy beast never needs to move more than an arm''s length - he steals all he needs straight from his owners hands!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(701,'en','The Oiram has many fans throughout the world who just love its classy look. This hat once belonged to a plumber who spent his days cleaning pipes. He was quite stylish himself.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(702,'en','This demon skull, constructed from various bones, gives its bearer a graceful and elegant look... Even your lover will be sick with envy...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(703,'en','This magical hat, which looks like an upside-down wicker fruit basket, is in fact... a magical upside-down fruit basket hat. It will certainly impress the neighbours, especially if they are Bwork Magus apprentices.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(704,'en','With this hat of leather Chafer briefs, the female Bwork magi won''t be able to resist you. That''s not a good thing, mind - many are known to wear long, red beards and none are known for their femininity.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(705,'en','If what you''re looking for is a bit of trauma, you''ll find great relief in this magnificent coconut. We remind you that a free straw and many a mouthful of fresh coconut-flavoured goodness are waiting for you inside.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(706,'en','Hung ''Short Memory'' Lekahurse owned a magnificent crystal ball, his grandpa gave it to him. He wisely decided to hold on to it for the rest of his life... In fact he put it on his hat which he never took off again... until one day, a jealous breeze took it away. He followed, and the breeze seemed to mock him, suspending the hat in the air, and whipping it away just as his searching fist approached. Not without a sense of decency, the wind took him home for a brief visit once a season and when it sensed the poor man was close to the end, took him to the edge of a cliff, hung the hat there for a moment AND... down Lekahurse tumbled... at peace at last.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(707,'en','With this hat of Minotoror''s Horns, you''ll have no problem passing yourself off as a Minotoror if your confidence in your own powers is failing. This trickery only works on simple-minded creatures such as Iops and Tofus.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(708,'en','This brand new larva skin magic green hat gives its bearer a jolly appearance... jolly but incredibly stupid. We can''t always get what we want and this hat is a perfect example.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(709,'en','This hat of enchanted bark once belonged to Lorko, a lumberjack. He challenged the renowned Brouce Boulgoure to an Elm uprooting duel in Liroye Merline.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(710,'en','The Korko Klako is a beautifo hato worno by the mo handso Sadido.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(711,'en','This magnificent leather mask once belonged to Jouik Krampe, cousin of Zeurg. They were both fond of tight leather clothes. A bit like Captain Chafer, only not as perverse.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(712,'en','This hat is so original that you will soon think you''re fantastic, unique and on top of the world. It is said that in bygone days, Rakmar Bilgout used it to charm the queen of the Gobballs. He didn''t hesitate to cut her throat open afterwards... Nothing to do with the hat I hope.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(732,'en','This magnificent wedding ring was stolen from Silimelle, a female brewer, during a boozy meal at the Inn. See what happens when you accept drinks from strangers?');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(733,'en','Without any doubt, Ragalde was one of the most foolhardy Iop warriors. With these magic boots, he slew a great number of enemies.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(734,'en','This belt is the weapon of choice for crowd control in Amakna prison and at the annual town fair.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(737,'en','Greener than a sick Tofu, the Emerald Dofus was created by Aerafal, the Air Dragon. To create such a green thing, he was certainly feeling airsick. That would be the last straw, wouldn''t it?');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(739,'en','The Turquoise Dofus was created by Aguabrial, the Water Dragon. It''s incredible what a Dragon can do with some water...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(742,'en','"I am the eggman, I am the Dofus. Waka fu ku." The last words recorded by the renowned Axe Smith-cum-Minstrel, Jon Lemon. Soon after, he was crushed by a Giant Tofu egg.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(744,'en','This cloak is an often underestimated one-of-a-kind. It is made of green larva skin, giving it a most pleasant, rugged appearance.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(754,'en','Marinated in pure blood for many long years, this cloak has acquired a ruby red colour that is very pleasing to the eye. This cloak is much favoured during the Dalouhine celebrations.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(758,'en','This cloak can only be worn by the great dispensers of justice... It''s not very popular.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(759,'en','This magnificent cloak was made with the feathers of the very last Cheeken of Amakna. It''s a real rarity that collectors dream of hanging on their living room wall.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(764,'en','This small amulet will delight inexperienced adventurers.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(765,'en','This scythe once belonged to Farle Ingalsse himself. It is sharp enough to mow any kind of cereal and any kind of monsters hidden in cereal fields.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(766,'en','This Amulet increases the damage of inexperienced adventurers.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(767,'en','Don''t mind its stuck-up name, this ring can only make your hero stronger. Okay, his chin will shrink too, but hey, who cares!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(768,'en','This ring influences your fate. You''ll be tougher but less lucky. In other words, you improve your chances of living a long time and ruin your chances of living happily.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(769,'en','These boots bring good fortune. Unfortunately, they decrease your resistance.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(770,'en','This magnificent pair of boots converts a bit of your strength into intelligence.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(771,'en','This Axe is nothing exceptional but it is appreciated by Lumberjack apprentices for its simplicity of use.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(772,'en','According to what people say, this legendary cloak makes you almost invisible when combined with the fencers'' legendary sword, the Dart Onion, and to the legendary hat of the Six Rams of the Rahk Shepherds.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(773,'en','This light cloak comes from the Patitalian Country, a place where people communicate with their limbs. This explains the incredible lightness and complete freedom of movement given by the cloak.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(774,'en','Coming from the Mount Taigüe, this cape ended up poisoning its former female owner... Strangely enough, if you wear it, it will increase your resistance.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(775,'en','This Cape has been made with infinite care and attention, it allows the wearer to find the enemy''s weak point.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(776,'en','A certain Mulba used this item to carry half her kitchen with her on a long, difficult quest to find the Seven Crystal Hens which fell from the stars. This cloak will make you strong and brave.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(777,'en','The battery cock whose feathers made this cape fought its killers for several days and nights before finally dying of exhaustion. Let me tell you, killing that crazy chicken nearly finished them off too.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(778,'en','This authentic bad guy cloak proves you belong to the gang of the diabolic Mori Arty. It is said that his bad luck equalled his astounding intelligence. Only true bad guys can wear it.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(779,'en','This cloak looks ordinary... but isn''t. It can make its wearer invisible to the eyes of those who are not looking at him. Really impressive!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(781,'en','This superb cloak once belonged to the Great Stratequerre. This renowned and expert strategist lord of war, hungry for the universe conquest, soon gave up his plans after having arrayed himself in the cloak. Really strange!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(782,'en','This very special axe was originally designed to teach budding lumberjacks the art of chopping. When it is well used, it can split a young carefree Treechnid in two, provided that such a Treechnid exists...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(783,'en','This amulet, made exclusively of precious wood, is highly prized and loved by lumberjacks who usually exaggerate its abilities to offset the cost of the material.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(784,'en','Mulish Cat was a renowned Ecaflip, and the most stupid in his class. In combat, the only match for his nonexistent intelligence was his bewildering luck.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(785,'en','The tradition of passing this ring down from grandfather to grandson gives it incredible power. This one is but a pale imitation of the original, but even so, it is much sought after by collectors, whether they are Enutrof or not.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(786,'en','The jeweller''s hand slipped while shaping this amulet, which imparts more intelligence to the wearer but in exchange, imparts a tear-inducing migraine, making it almost impossible to see anything.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(787,'en','This strange little ring can increase the agility of the wearer in exchange for chance points.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(789,'en','This belt is all the rage among young Amaknians. A follower of Sadida, couturier by trade, is behind this fashion. When he sold it for the first time, he said :"Life is short, play hard!"');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(790,'en','The magic effects of this cape are often overestimated, which inevitably caused heavy losses in adventurers, such as the notorious minstrel Jon Lemon.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(791,'en','This is a staff made of living Treechnid roots. But watch out... It has a tendency to turn on its master. When it does decide to attack the same target as you, it can be very deadly.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(819,'en','A holy sword awarded to young warriors during their training.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(820,'en','A holy sword awarded to young warriors during their training.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(821,'en','A holy sword awarded to young warriors during their training.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(822,'en','The Little Knight Sword is an efficient and sturdy sword. Properly used, it can inflict serious damage upon your enemies.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(823,'en','The Little Knight Sword is an efficient and sturdy sword. Properly used, it can inflict serious damage upon your enemies.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(824,'en','The Little Knight Sword is an efficient and sturdy sword. Properly used, it can inflict serious damage upon your enemies.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(825,'en','This basic sword can usually be handled by the most cretinous of Bworks, that is to say the ones who are incapable of using a bow or a staff... Some of these geniuses even mistake the blade for the handle. The tradition in this case is for the Bwork to poke its own eyes out with its fingers... Lovely!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(826,'en','This basic sword can usually be handled by the most cretinous of Bworks, that is to say the ones who are incapable of using a bow or a staff... Some of these geniuses even mistake the blade for the handle. The tradition in this case is for the Bwork to poke its own eyes out with its fingers... Lovely!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(827,'en','This basic sword can usually be handled by the most cretinous of Bworks, that is to say the ones who are incapable of using a bow or a staff... Some of these geniuses even mistake the blade for the handle. The tradition in this case is for the Bwork to poke its own eyes out with its fingers... Lovely!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(828,'en','This bow fires its arrows so rapidly that the whistling sound travels for miles. A sound piece of advice: if you want to be discreet, equip it with a silencer.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(829,'en','Due its restricted range, this bow is not very popular... Use it to weaken your enemies before finishing them off with a close-range weapon or a crafty spell.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(830,'en','This wand increases intelligence');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(831,'en','This wand increases intelligence');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(832,'en','This wand increases intelligence');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(833,'en','This wand increases wisdom');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(834,'en','This wand increases wisdom');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(835,'en','This wand increases wisdom');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(836,'en','This ring, made of Treechnid bark, has great powers but carries great responsibility with it. However, in spite of its value, it is said to be cursed.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(837,'en','These boots increase your strength but they affect your intelligence. They could even turn you into a Iop in case of prolonged and regular use.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(841,'en','This ring increases AP in exchange for some strength and intelligence.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(849,'en','This small ring increases Strength.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(850,'en','Amaknean collectors are desperate to get their fingers into this ring, though it''s not worth a penny.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(851,'en','This small ring increases Life.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(852,'en','This small ring increases Intelligence.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(853,'en','This ring slightly increases Luck.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(854,'en','This small amulet increases strength.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(856,'en','This small amulet increases agility');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(859,'en','This basic belt increases agility.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(860,'en','This basic belt increases luck.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(861,'en','These boots increase the strength of the wearer in exchange for agility, making them totally unlike a Tofu in all but intelligence.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(862,'en','These sandals increase the intelligence of the wearer. They are also eternally fashionable. They are finished off with a breathable walnut sole for exquisite grip.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(863,'en','These boots increase the agility of the wearer so that he can get into character as a Tofu every time he feels like making a fool of himself.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(864,'en','These boots increase your luck in finding powerful items such as Gobball saliva.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(867,'en','Made of Dreggon remains, this splendid amulet is impressive enough to make your bravest enemies run home sobbing.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(888,'en','These boots are so comfortable that they instantly increase your concentration.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(889,'en','These boots are so comfortable that they instantly increase your concentration.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(890,'en','These boots are made of Gobball leather. Thanks to the smell they give off, breeders can approach and kill other Gobballs with the slightest of ease.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(891,'en','These boots are made of Gobball leather. Thanks to the smell they give off, breeders can approach and kill other Gobballs with the slightest of ease.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(892,'en','These boots are made of Gobball leather. Thanks to the smell they give off, breeders can approach and kill other Gobballs with the slightest of ease.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(893,'en','These daggers were created for cutting roots and young saplings in spring time but they were soon decommissioned in favour of quite a different purpose...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(894,'en','These daggers were created for cutting roots and young saplings in spring time but they were soon decommissioned in favour of quite a different purpose...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(895,'en','These daggers were created for cutting roots and young saplings in spring time but they were soon decommissioned in favour of quite a different purpose...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(896,'en','These daggers were created for cutting roots and young saplings in spring time but they were soon decommissioned in favour of quite a different purpose...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(897,'en','These modest-looking daggers are extremely dangerous. They are easily hidden down the pants which makes them a weapon of choice for murderous eunuchs throughout the land. The words chicken and egg come to mind...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(898,'en','These modest-looking daggers are extremely dangerous. They are easily hidden down the pants which makes them a weapon of choice for murderous eunuchs throughout the land. The words chicken and egg come to mind...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(899,'en','These modest-looking daggers are extremely dangerous. They are easily hidden down the pants which makes them a weapon of choice for murderous eunuchs throughout the land. The words chicken and egg come to mind...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(900,'en','These modest-looking daggers are extremely dangerous. They are easily hidden down the pants which makes them a weapon of choice for murderous eunuchs throughout the land. The words chicken and egg come to mind...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(902,'en','These boots gave such agility to Klime the Shoemaker that he was able to ride Gobballs. He died when he mistook a Jelly for a Gobball... It was the day of his brother''s wedding, he was understandably a little under the weather.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(903,'en','These boots gave such agility to Klime the Shoemaker that he was able to ride Gobballs. He died when he mistook a Jelly for a Gobball... It was the day of his brother''s wedding, he was understandably a little under the weather.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(904,'en','These boots gave such agility to Klime the Shoemaker that he was able to ride Gobballs. He died when he mistook a Jelly for a Gobball... It was the day of his brother''s wedding, he was understandably a little under the weather.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(905,'en','According to the legend, these boots were secretly replaced by another pair, which though defective, were ultra-powerful; they were made by a clumsy, overworked shoemaker.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(906,'en','With these boots, Hogmeiser used to chase off the only human beings he couldn''t stand the sight of: children. Fortunately for them, the weight of the footwear prevented him from ever catching a single one.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(907,'en','With these boots, Hogmeiser used to chase off the only human beings he couldn''t stand the sight of: children. Fortunately for them, the weight of the footwear prevented him from ever catching a single one.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(908,'en','With these boots, Hogmeiser used to chase off the only human beings he couldn''t stand the sight of: children. Fortunately for them, the weight of the footwear prevented him from ever catching a single one.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(909,'en','With these boots, Hogmeiser used to chase off the only human beings he couldn''t stand the sight of: children. Fortunately for them, the weight of the footwear prevented him from ever catching a single one.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(910,'en','These boots belonged to Hogmeiser for many years, before he actually lost them on a stupid bet with Grizmine. The moral of this story is... never gamble with an Ecaflip.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(911,'en','These boots seem to have belonged to Hogmeiser for many years. They are now worn and uncomfortable. If you''re lucky enough, a good shoemaker will repair them for you.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(912,'en','These magnificent Hogmeiser boots are finely peppered with precious stones, protecting you against magic attacks. Brouce Boulgoure himself used them to crush the Treechnid King''s head many years ago, just to liven up the opening of the Trool Fair.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(916,'en','Silicate made this amulet on a wintry morning for a famous adventurer named Rimb Vardi, who was hunting down an old Magus Bwork. The bungling magic that followed was the root of many a natural disaster.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(917,'en','This Brooch was made one fall morning in the depths of a Beech and Elm forest, near the Olag-Lacustre Island. It is considered to be a true relic by a great many Lumberjacks.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(919,'en','These powerful daggers, forged from Ancestral Amber according to ancient techniques, were used during the colonization of Moon Island. It soon became wild again.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(922,'en','An essential tool for making axes.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(923,'en','This battle axe was forged by Kademlia Boulgoure to fight against the most terrifying Treechnids. Legend has it that this legendary weapon killed more Treechnids in a night than there are trees in Amakna.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(924,'en','These boots gave such agility to Klime the Shoemaker that he was able to ride Gobballs. He died when he mistook a Jelly for a Gobball... It was the day of his brother''s wedding, he was understandably a little under the weather.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(927,'en','This battle axe was forged by Kademlia Boulgoure to fight against the Ancestral Treechnid. Only the best warriors can handle it.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(928,'en','Ogralimde was a great warrior who derived his strength from his master Adyol, an exceptionally intelligent and powerful Bwork Magus. This apprentice never surpassed his master.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(932,'en','This cloak increases life.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(933,'en','This cloak increases life.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(934,'en','This cloak increases life.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(935,'en','This cloak increases chance.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(936,'en','This cloak increases chance.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(937,'en','This cloak increases chance');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(940,'en','The Farter protects you from physical damage.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(941,'en','The Komintot increases the wisdom of the wearer.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(942,'en','The Smoother resists magic damage.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(943,'en','This headband increases vitality.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(944,'en','This headband increases vitality.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(945,'en','This cloak increases wisdom.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(946,'en','This cloak increases wisdom.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(947,'en','This cloak increases wisdom.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(948,'en','This magnificent cloak is a clever mix of Treechnid essence and nice familial Gobball.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(949,'en','This headband increases vitality.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(952,'en','This cloak was made of hairs and other organic elements taken from Boowolves... I can smell its power from here...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(953,'en','With this handmade cloak of Tofu feathers, you will be able to run faster and escape from tackle zones with the grace of a shotgun-blasted pigeon...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(954,'en','The Samoulaille is a legendary cloak, embroidered specially for warriors who live for close combat situations.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(955,'en','Hairdressers use the Cape Hillary to tie up their hair. Will you?');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(956,'en','This cloak increases your range, allowing distant targets to be attacked... or naïve adventurers to be dumbfounded into unsuspecting admiration. Haha!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(957,'en','The Gobb increases damage and vitality, but it gives off a nasty odour, too. Don''t be surprised if the Gobballs think you''re one of the gang.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(958,'en','This cloak is certainly one of the most powerful of its kind in the world. It increases all the characteristics of its wearer.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(967,'en','This magnificent cloak increases AP, as well as vitality and wisdom.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(968,'en','This magnificent belt increases action points, vitality and wisdom.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(969,'en','This magnificent Crown once belonged to the notorious Wa Wabbit.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(970,'en','This staff once belonged to the notorious Wa Wabbit.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(971,'en','This cloak once belonged to the notorious Wa Wabbit. It is still impregnated with his perspiration which will bring back a few memories of the amazing fight every time you put it on.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(972,'en','The Cawwot Dofus increases its bearer''s wisdom.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(976,'en','A distinctive feature of the Pumpkwin is that it prevents the dispersion of magic particles, making it a good magic insulator. That''s why some warriors use this vegetable as headgear.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1019,'en','With that Helmet on, you''ll have a very special look... halfway between ridiculous and comical.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1021,'en','For those who have always dreamt of flying like a Kwak, go back to bed because these wings will turn you into a public menace and an idiot.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1026,'en','One day, the infamously crazy T. Bun Stek found two strange yet impressive knives... No one could figure out what they were for. He used the very same knives to sacrifice half his livestock to the Gods and soon after they bellowed the answer from the heave''s. He was slaughtering a particularly noisy cow at that very moment... The poor guy didn''t hear a word.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1027,'en','One day, the infamously crazy T. Bun Stek found two strange yet impressive knives... No one could figure out what they were for. He used the very same knives to sacrifice half his livestock to the Gods and soon after they bellowed the answer from the heave''s. He was slaughtering a particularly noisy cow at that very moment... The poor guy didn''t hear a word.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1028,'en','One day, the infamously crazy T. Bun Stek found two strange yet impressive knives... No one could figure out what they were for. He used the very same knives to sacrifice half his livestock to the Gods and soon after they bellowed the answer from the heave''s. He was slaughtering a particularly noisy cow at that very moment... The poor guy didn''t hear a word.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1029,'en','One day, the infamously crazy T. Bun Stek found two strange yet impressive knives... No one could figure out what they were for. He used the very same knives to sacrifice half his livestock to the Gods and soon after they bellowed the answer from the heave''s. He was slaughtering a particularly noisy cow at that very moment... The poor guy didn''t hear a word.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1030,'en','This pair of daggers is in fact a magic game. Designed to entertain young Ecaflips, it was taken off the market when a visiting Sram decided to join. She was only a child... Shame on you... shame on us all.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1031,'en','These magnificent daggers once belonged to the cruellest Sramette Amakna ever saw... Just being AS cruel as most Srams is quite an achievement... She was bad.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1032,'en','This dagger was originally used by the secret brotherhood of Rowler. This guild wanted to plunge Amakna into chaos. They finally disappeared when the island where they hid and schemed was submerged by the waves.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1033,'en','This dagger was originally used by the secret brotherhood of Rowler. This guild wanted to plunge Amakna into chaos. They finally disappeared when the island where they hid and schemed was submerged by the waves.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1034,'en','This dagger was originally used by the secret brotherhood of Rowler. This guild wanted to plunge Amakna into chaos. They finally disappeared when the island where they hid and schemed was submerged by the waves.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1035,'en','This dagger was originally used by the secret brotherhood of Rowler. This guild wanted to plunge Amakna into chaos. They finally disappeared when the island where they hid and schemed was submerged by the waves.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1036,'en','This Sram dagger is beguilingly shaped, leading one to wonder if it is a dagger at all. When the piercing truth is revealed, it is often too late...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1037,'en','This Sram dagger is beguilingly shaped, leading one to wonder if it is a dagger at all. When the piercing truth is revealed, it is often too late...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1038,'en','This Sram dagger is beguilingly shaped, leading one to wonder if it is a dagger at all. When the piercing truth is revealed, it is often too late...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1039,'en','This Sram dagger is beguilingly shaped, leading one to wonder if it is a dagger at all. When the piercing truth is revealed, it is often too late...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1040,'en','Ortimus Contrari is a legendary assassin. If I told you how he carried out his contracts... you''d want to kill yourself even before he got to you.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1041,'en','The legends tell of a famous Iop who left his island home and travelled across the sea to find work as an interpreter for the Kings of Amakna. He took to the job full of hope, enthusiasm and diligence, dazzling Ecaflips and Fecas alike with his vibrant wordplay and passion for good grammar. Unfortunately, on his way to the castle, he stumbled over a rock that turned out to be a Mega Crackler, and this broken sword was the only trace they found of him, or his equipment.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1042,'en','This shovel is made of a very rare wood. According to the legend, young girls fall into an eternal sleep when they touch this weapon. Note that in case of repeated contact, valiant heroes can also be affected.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1043,'en','This shovel is made of a very rare wood. According to the legend, young girls fall into an eternal sleep when they touch this weapon. Note that in case of repeated contact, valiant heroes can also be affected.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1044,'en','This shovel is made of a very rare wood. According to the legend, young girls fall into an eternal sleep when they touch this weapon. Note that in case of repeated contact, valiant heroes can also be affected.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1045,'en','This shovel is made of a very rare wood. According to the legend, young girls fall into an eternal sleep when they touch this weapon. Note that in case of repeated contact, valiant heroes can also be affected.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1046,'en','What can be better than an eco-friendly shovel to clear your garden of weeds? This shovel is THE best way of getting rid of daisies. It''s also great to feed them to your enemies.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1047,'en','What can be better than an eco-friendly shovel to clear your garden of weeds? This shovel is THE best way of getting rid of daisies. It''s also great to feed them to your enemies.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1048,'en','What can be better than an eco-friendly shovel to clear your garden of weeds? This shovel is THE best way of getting rid of daisies. It''s also great to feed them to your enemies.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1049,'en','What can be better than an eco-friendly shovel to clear your garden of weeds? This shovel is THE best way of getting rid of daisies. It''s also great to feed them to your enemies.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1050,'en','The Woukuis family forged this shovel during the war between the Elle-Poma and the Touge-Woukuis. The one problem is that it covers your hands with grease. It''s also very popular with unmarried warriors who spend a lot of time alone. Dunno why.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1051,'en','The Woukuis family forged this shovel during the big war between the Elle-Poma and the Touge-Woukuis. The one problem is that it covers your hands with grease. It''s also very popular with unmarried warriors who spend a lot of time alone. Dunno why.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1052,'en','The Woukuis family forged this shovel during the war between the Elle-Poma and the Touge-Woukuis. The one problem is that it covers your hands with grease. It''s also very popular with unmarried warriors who spend a lot of time alone. Dunno why.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1053,'en','The Woukuis family forged this shovel during the war between the Elle-Poma and the Touge-Woukuis. The one problem is that it covers your hands with grease. It''s also very popular with unmarried warriors who spend a lot of time alone. Dunno why.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1054,'en','Half trowel and half shovel, the Trovel went out of fashion with builders and was remarketed as a weapon. Easy to handle and to put away thanks to its size, it''s the ideal accessory for any Enutrof that''s fond of a drink.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1055,'en','These ghastly shovels are hand-crafted by the islanders of Koutoulou who use whatever materials come to hand to make them. Useless for digging holes, their main purpose is to ward off imaginary spirits and naughty children.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1056,'en','These ghastly shovels are hand-crafted by the islanders of Koutoulou who use whatever materials come to hand to make them. Useless for digging holes, their main purpose is to ward off imaginary spirits and naughty children.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1057,'en','These ghastly shovels are hand-crafted by the islanders of Koutoulou who use whatever materials come to hand to make them. Useless for digging holes, their main purpose is to ward off imaginary spirits and naughty children.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1058,'en','These ghastly shovels are hand-crafted by the islanders of Koutoulou who use whatever materials come to hand to make them. Useless for digging holes, their main purpose is to ward off imaginary spirits and naughty children.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1059,'en','This shovel is much favoured by the potato farmers of the region. It can be used for all kinds of crops however.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1060,'en','A weapon created by Dha, this aerodynamic mace hurts the very air as it cleaves through and splits your enemies skulls open... Are you convinced yet?');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1061,'en','A weapon created by Dha, this aerodynamic mace hurts the very air as it cleaves through and splits your enemies skulls open... Are you convinced yet?');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1062,'en','A weapon created by Dha, this aerodynamic mace hurts the very air as it cleaves through and splits your enemies skulls open... Are you convinced yet?');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1063,'en','A weapon created by Dha, this aerodynamic mace hurts the very air as it cleaves through and splits your enemies skulls open... Are you convinced yet?');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1064,'en','Rumour has it that this hammer is one of a kind, handmade by the ancient Xelor Smiths. Some people are convinced it is a copy, only carrying a convincing forgery of the Xelor rune... Go find out for yourself, hit someone over the head with it!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1065,'en','Rumour has it that this hammer is one of a kind, handmade by the ancient Xelor Smiths. Some people are convinced it is a copy, only carrying a convincing forgery of the Xelor rune... Go find out for yourself, hit someone over the head with it!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1066,'en','Rumour has it that this hammer is one of a kind, handmade by the ancient Xelor Smiths. Some people are convinced it is a copy, only carrying a convincing forgery of the Xelor rune... Go find out for yourself, hit someone over the head with it!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1067,'en','Rumour has it that this hammer is one of a kind, handmade by the ancient Xelor Smiths. Some people are convinced it is a copy, only carrying a convincing forgery of the Xelor rune... Go find out for yourself, hit someone over the head with it!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1068,'en','Before being struck by lightning for the last time, the creator of this mace truly thought it would allow him forecast the weather. Much later, it was discovered that the tool was better at giving than taking blows.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1069,'en','Before being struck by lightning for the last time, the creator of this mace truly thought it would allow him forecast the weather. Much later, it was discovered that the tool was better at giving than taking blows.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1070,'en','Before being struck by lightning for the last time, the creator of this mace truly thought it would allow him forecast the weather. Much later, it was discovered that the tool was better at giving than taking blows.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1071,'en','Before being struck by lightning for the last time, the creator of this mace truly thought it would allow him forecast the weather. Much later, it was discovered that the tool was better at giving than taking blows.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1072,'en','According to the legend, Outar Great Bwork ordered these fearsome hammers from a village of Xelors with the promise of sparing the townspeople if the hammers were well made. When he received the hammers, he destroyed the village. He needed to try his new weapons after all.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1073,'en','According to the legend, Outar Great Bwork ordered these fearsome hammers from a village of Xelors with the promise of sparing the townspeople if the hammers were well made. When he received the hammers, he destroyed the village. He needed to try his new weapons after all.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1074,'en','According to the legend, Outar Great Bwork ordered these fearsome hammers from a village of Xelors with the promise of sparing the townspeople if the hammers were well made. When he received the hammers, he destroyed the village. He needed to try his new weapons after all.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1075,'en','According to the legend, Outar Great Bwork ordered these fearsome hammers from a village of Xelors with the promise of sparing the townspeople if the hammers were well made. When he received the hammers, he destroyed the village. He needed to try his new weapons after all.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1076,'en','This mace is the sole heritage left by the pacific Aj Taye tribe. Roll it on aching muscles and the pain will disappear. Big bullies will tell you it''s quite good at making pain appear as well.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1077,'en','This mace is the sole heritage left by the pacific Aj Taye tribe. Roll it on aching muscles and the pain will disappear. Big bullies will tell you it''s quite good at making pain appear as well.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1078,'en','This mace is the sole heritage left by the pacific Aj Taye tribe. Roll it on aching muscles and the pain will disappear. Big bullies will tell you it''s quite efficient to make pain appear as well.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1079,'en','This mace is the sole heritage left by the pacific Aj Taye tribe. Roll it on aching muscles and the pain will disappear. Big bullies will tell you it''s quite good at making pain appear as well.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1080,'en','This hammer is so ridiculous that your enemy will laugh his head off. This should give you just enough time to beat it off with the very same hammer... Is that ironic?');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1081,'en','This hammer is so ridiculous that your enemy will laugh his head off. This should give you just enough time to beat it off with the very same hammer... Is that ironic?');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1082,'en','This hammer is so ridiculous that your enemy will laugh his head off. This should give you just enough time to beat it off with the very same hammer... Is that ironic?');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1083,'en','This hammer is so ridiculous that your enemy will laugh his head off. This should give you just enough time to beat it off with the very same hammer... Is that ironic?');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1084,'en','With this fearsome Hammer you will be able to prove the popular belief that muscles are more important than intelligence. This logic only works for people who are weaker than you, however. As we say ourselves... Strong is... never wrong.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1085,'en','Falistos are Xelor demons. They betrayed their old principles and increased their strength by forging more and more powerful hammers. After spreading chaos across the land, they were defeated and banished underground. But some of the weapons they forged remained intact...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1087,'en','This ring slightly increases intelligence.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1088,'en','This mask is the faithful replica, only a bit bigger, of the ones proudly worn by the important Kanniballs.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1090,'en','You''ll have the perfect hairdo with the Astrowig.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1092,'en','This bow is specifically designed to hunt birds. Light and easy to handle, you''ll be able to sneak up on an eagle.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1093,'en','This bow is specifically designed to hunt birds. Light and easy to handle, you''ll be able to sneak up on an eagle.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1094,'en','This bow is specifically designed to hunt birds. Light and easy to handle, you''ll be able to sneak up on an eagle.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1095,'en','This bow is specifically designed to hunt birds. Light and easy to handle, you''ll be able to sneak up on an eagle.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1096,'en','"With a Gobball, no waste at all!" Such was the motto of a visionary shopkeeper who specialised in recycling Gobball carcasses. This bow is one of his best products, not for aesthetic reasons, but simply because it''s a fearsome weapon.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1097,'en','"With a Gobball, no waste at all!" Such was the motto of a visionary shopkeeper who specialised in recycling Gobball carcasses. This bow is one of his best products, not for aesthetic reasons, but simply because it''s a fearsome weapon.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1098,'en','"With a Gobball, no waste at all!" Such was the motto of a visionary shopkeeper who specialised in recycling Gobball carcasses. This bow is one of his best products, not for aesthetic reasons, but simply because it''s a fearsome weapon.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1099,'en','For test only.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1101,'en','The Eniripsa Mie Dopan made this series of sharpened wands to fight against the rising level of burglaries in the area. It can travel through time and nip any aggression in the bud. They often appear in hospitals, disguised as nurses asking stuff like, ''Have you seen so and so... well, he hasn''t been born yet. Yeah a real nasty character.''');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1102,'en','The Eniripsa Mie Dopan made this series of sharpened wands to fight against the rising level of burglaries in the area. It can travel through time and nip any aggression in the bud. They often appear in hospitals, disguised as nurses asking stuff like, ''Have you seen so and so... well, he hasn''t been born yet. Yeah a real nasty character.''');
