INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1104,'en','The Eniripsa Mie Dopan made this series of sharpened wands to fight against the rising level of burglaries in the area. It can travel through time and nip any aggression in the bud. They often appear in hospitals, disguised as nurses asking stuff like, ''Have you seen so and so... well, he hasn''t been born yet. Yeah a real nasty character.''');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1105,'en','This heavy Wand shattered more than one soul''s skull. Iop priests use it to send repentant sinners to heaven with a bang.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1107,'en','This heavy Wand shattered more than one soul''s skull. Iop priests use it to send repentant sinners to heaven with a bang.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1108,'en','This heavy Wand shattered more than one soul''s skull. Iop priests use it to send repentant sinners to heaven with a bang.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1109,'en','This staff is a replica of a legendary artefact, but with slightly lesser powers. It sends out light if it falls on the ground and it can distort your voice to any pitch you desire. The latter feature is useful for luring enemies into mortal traps... just don''t try to kill them with it when they fall for your trick.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1110,'en','This staff is a replica of a legendary artefact, but with slightly lesser powers. It sends out light if it falls on the ground and it can distort your voice to any pitch you desire. The latter feature is useful for luring enemies into mortal traps... just don''t try to kill them with it when they fall for your trick.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1111,'en','This staff is a replica of a legendary artefact, but with slightly lesser powers. It sends out light if it falls on the ground and it can distort your voice to any pitch you desire. The latter feature is useful for luring enemies into mortal traps... just don''t try to kill them with it when they fall for your trick.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1112,'en','"With a Gobball, no waste at all!" Such was the motto of a visionary shopkeeper who specialised in recycling Gobball carcasses. This bow is one of his best products, not for aesthetic reasons, but simply because it''s a fearsome weapon.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1113,'en','A type of bow only made in the far North of Amakna, the I Kea Bow is a cheap, conveniently flat-packed weapon. Its effectiveness will strongly depend on the owner''s ability to follow poorly translated instruction manuals.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(1114,'en','A type of bow only made in the far North of Amakna, the I Kea Bow is a cheap, conveniently flat-packed weapon. Its effectiveness will strongly depend on the owner''s ability to follow poorly translated instruction manuals.');
