INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(7712,'en','This little Piwin is not like the others, one look at its colour and that is clear. However, it seems to share the same inexplicable interest in pecking posteriors. Don''t be shocked when I tell you that some people actually enjoy being aggressed by the little creatures. This pet only eats seeds.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10000046,'en','This little Piwin is not like the others, one look at its colour and that is clear. However, it seems to share the same inexplicable interest in pecking posteriors. Don''t be shocked when I tell you that some people actually enjoy being aggressed by the little creatures. This pet only eats seeds.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(7713,'en','This little Piwin is not like the others, one look at its colour and that is clear. However, it seems to share the same inexplicable interest in pecking posteriors. Don''t be shocked when I tell you that some people actually enjoy being aggressed by the little creatures. This pet only eats seeds.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(7714,'en','Rumour has it that this turtle has been raised by a Martial Arts Master who resembled a Grossewer Rat. If you feed it with fish, it will be nice to you and will help you heal injured adventurers. If you feed it with meat, it will be aggressive and will help you fight your enemies.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(7753,'en','This wand comes straight from the hottest depths of the earth. Buy a good thick pair of gloves before handling this thing.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(7754,'en','Laid by Terrakourial the Earth Dragon, this Dofus contains considerable powers and shouldn''t be given to just anyone.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(7806,'en','This certificate authorizes you to pick up your mount at a stable. 
Warning! This certificate will only be valid for 20 days. Once this time limit is over, your mount will be sent back to the wild and your certificate will no longer be valid. You will not be able to reclaim your mount. Always leave your mount in a stable if you go away for a long time.');
