INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(9752,'en','This weapon is a Shushumi and can steal Rushu''s Shushus soul fragments from monsters. When you have a fragment, you can try to embed it in a weapon to make it more powerful.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(9753,'en','This weapon is a Shushumi and can steal Rushu''s Shushus soul fragments from monsters. When you have a fragment, you can try to embed it in a weapon to make it more powerful.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(9754,'en','This weapon is a Shushumi and can steal Rushu''s Shushus soul fragments from monsters. When you have a fragment, you can try to embed it in a weapon to make it more powerful.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(9755,'en','This weapon is a Shushumi and can steal Rushu''s Shushus soul fragments from monsters. When you have a fragment, you can try to embed it in a weapon to make it more powerful.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(9756,'en','This weapon is a Shushumi and can steal Rushu''s Shushus soul fragments from monsters. When you have a fragment, you can try to embed it in a weapon to make it more powerful.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(9757,'en','This weapon is a Shushumi and can steal Rushu''s Shushus soul fragments from monsters. When you have a fragment, you can try to embed it in a weapon to make it more powerful.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(9758,'en','This weapon is a Shushumi and can steal Rushu''s Shushus soul fragments from monsters. When you have a fragment, you can try to embed it in a weapon to make it more powerful.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(9759,'en','This weapon is a Shushumi and can steal Rushu''s Shushus soul fragments from monsters. When you have a fragment, you can try to embed it in a weapon to make it more powerful.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(9785,'en','This demon will accompany you throughout all of your wandering, from the Astrub Zaap to the cemetery and maybe even to the cemetery from the Astrub Zaap. It is also full of bitter hatred for Ouassingues... it''s a long story, but it has something to do with a dirty floor and a bucket of hot water. If you attack a Ouassingue, this demon will be happy to help!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10000063,'en','This demon will accompany you throughout all of your wandering, from the Astrub Zaap to the cemetery and maybe even to the cemetery from the Astrub Zaap. It is also full of bitter hatred for Ouassingues... it''s a long story, but it has something to do with a dirty floor and a bucket of hot water. If you attack a Ouassingue, this demon will be happy to help!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(9919,'en','Take on the appearance of an owl.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(9921,'en','They say this bracelet is shiny, but only when you''re in an inn or in the middle of the night.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(9922,'en','This belt has an incredibly powerful piece of metal with polarized attraction and repulsion properties built in to it which keeps it shut without a buckle. It''s often used as added protection along with a chastity belt.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(9923,'en','The headspinners among you will have very little use for these shoes, but if you use your feet from time to time, they''re just what you need.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(9924,'en','The legend says that these horns were used as a lightning conductor, concentrating lightning for several hours and then projecting bolts towards any unwary people who approached too closely. Another legend says they just make their wearer look ridiculous.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(9925,'en','This ring is closer to a glove or a mitten than a wedding ring, but who cares, no one will ever shake your hand the same way again.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(9926,'en','This double-headed axe can cut off two heads in one swing, which equates to an eighth of a sixteen-headed hydra.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(9927,'en','If you wear these boots when climbing Mount Jifu, you''re almost guaranteed to see strange UFO flying across the sky.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(9928,'en','These boots take approximately 12 hours to tie up and slightly longer to get off. That gives you just enough time to get some sleep every day or so, so long as you''re single, unemployed, and very good with your hands.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(9929,'en','The Achilles heel isn''t always below the knees, you know. Sometimes it''s just below the waist. In that case, this heavy but effective belt will give all those wieners among you peace of mind and sackfulls of confidence.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(9930,'en','This mask not only gives you appearance of a terrifying, murderous man-eater, it''ll also protect your delicate rosy cheeks from harsh wind and hot sun.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(9931,'en','Long at the back, short on top, this hairdo has a bad reputation, but you''ll surely change all that.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(9933,'en','Every catcher knows the most dangerous part of wrestling is the crowd. So when the chairs and bottles come flying into the ring, wrap this Pikoko fur cape around yourself and curl up into the foetal position.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(9936,'en','This helmet is perfect for people who look too kind. That can be very dangerous in the World of Twelve.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(9937,'en','This hat comes with a fake toothbrush moustache, which is nice until you find yourself mistaken for a great dictator.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(9938,'en','This sword''s blade was soaked in concentrated firefly juice for 18 months to make it glow in the dark. It now stinks in the dark too, by the way.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(9939,'en','This flexible bamboo cane is definitely not for leaning on... try twirling it round in the air instead.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(9942,'en','This ring is also known as the Black Band, but in spite of its two names, it remains unfinished. Even so, it''s powerful enough to destroy a small planet.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(9943,'en','These shoes are rumoured to have been eaten by a starved gold miner only to be stitched back together when they came out the other end. That must be why they''re so shiny.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(9944,'en','This charm is an amulet and a cravat in one, and it''ll give you the air of a gentleman even when you''re down and out.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(9945,'en','Newddha the Prophet is famous for renouncing his family''s wealth and sitting under a Kokonut tree, waiting for enlightenment to dawn upon him. Instead, a giant Kokonut cracked him on the head, leading him to leave all that spiritual nonsense behind for good.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(9957,'en','You are in possession of Crocoburio''s soul. This blade, that you pulled out of the mythical stone in the depths of the marshes, can only to be handled by a select few. Passing it on to someone else would be an affront to the memory of Crocoburio himself.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(9961,'en','This stone hammer was invented to lure smiths into believing that they were holding a hammer of excellent quality. It is strongly advised that you do not touch it, better still, do absolutely nothing with it at all.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(9972,'en','This hammer, to be used in a forge, was created for a specific purpose, which makes it difficult to use for anything else. Only someone desperate or on the margins of society would use it to make weapons.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(9974,'en','This slasher is for slashing handles, not candles. You can dangle a candle on your sandals, you vandal, but the scandal would be too much for Randall to handle. And no, I don''t know who Randall is, either.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10054,'en','This ring spent three years in a pool of Borbat guano. It''s still magic, though.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10055,'en','This amulet is supposed to stop Vampyres sucking your blood. The idea is that they''re meant to believe you''re a Vampyre too.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10056,'en','This belt not only glows in the dark, it also glows in the light, although it''s hard to be sure.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10058,'en','Bram was right after all, you should watch out for grown men who prance around with makeup and long, flowing capes.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10061,'en','They say that Countess Bathory herself used to wear these boots. Knowing her, they should be nice and soft... just hope there aren''t too many pimples on them.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10073,'en','The legendary Dal-Uk-Wet, who unified the Kingdom of Hispania, had a magic shield! Sir-Dal, his great grand-son, had copies forged to reward his best warriors. This shield is one of these copies.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10076,'en','The legendary Dal-Uk-Wet, who unified the Kingdom of Hispania, concentrated all his powers into his shield to his enemies'' great displeasure. Years later, Sir-Dal, his great grand-son, had copies forged to reward his best warriors... but this is the genuine and most powerful shields of all!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10102,'en','This mask will protect you from the sun if nothing else.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10106,'en','This terrifying creature takes cruel pleasure in sucking the blood out of her victims, and you''ll be next if you''re not careful. What she likes most of all, though, is sinking her teeth into a big filthy Skeleton and nibbling every last edible morsel off their bones. We told you she was terrifying.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10000070,'en','This terrifying creature takes cruel pleasure in sucking the blood out of her victims, and you''ll be next if you''re not careful. What she likes most of all, though, is sinking her teeth into a big filthy Skeleton and nibbling every last edible morsel off their bones. We told you she was terrifying.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10107,'en','This pet had a long, hard childhood, starting with its name. Maybe all this explains why its only obsession in life is killing Ouassingues and eating anything left on their bones.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10125,'en','This bow belonged to a bandit archer of old who used it to finish his victims off from a distance, so as not to get his clothes dirty. The magic which animates it is of such power that it can turn the heart of a saint into the gut of a daring bandit archer.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10126,'en','This sword belonged to a legendary swashbuckler who couldn''t stand chasing after his enemies. He learnt how to creep and crawl, and then took to cutting their legs off in the night. The magic which animates it is of such power that it can turn the heart of a saint into the gut of a daring swashbuckler.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10127,'en','The wandering bandit who used to own this staff was terrible for the drink, and used to use his trusty pole to hold himself up while he practiced his noble profession - picking pockets. The magic which animates it is of such power that it can turn the heart of a saint into the gut of a daring bandit.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10133,'en','Long, long ago this wand belonged to a Bandit Sorcerer who used it to reduce his enemies to ashes. The magic which animates it is of such power that it can turn the heart of a saint into the gut of a daring Bandit Sorcerer.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10155,'en','This amulet is meant to protect you from random beheadings, but it increases your chances of dying from a random hanging.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10156,'en','These slippers are more comfortable than your average footwear, but it''s hard to say why... perhaps the parasites that infest them massage your feet.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10157,'en','This belt was made using the leftovers from spools of Flax String. It ties up rubbish bags too.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10158,'en','Hold it high and proud, because this trophy is all that will be left of your glory when you''re gone.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10159,'en','Hold it high and proud, because this trophy is all that will be left of your glory when you''re gone.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10160,'en','Hold it high and proud, because this trophy is all that will be left of your glory when you''re gone.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10161,'en','Hold it high and proud, because this trophy is all that will be left of your glory when you''re gone.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10162,'en','Hold it high and proud, because this trophy is all that will be left of your glory when you''re gone.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10163,'en','Hold it high and proud, because this trophy is all that will be left of your glory when you''re gone.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10164,'en','Hold it high and proud, because this trophy is all that will be left of your glory when you''re gone.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10165,'en','Hold it high and proud, because this trophy is all that will be left of your glory when you''re gone.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10166,'en','Hold it high and proud, because this trophy is all that will be left of your glory when you''re gone.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10167,'en','Hold it high and proud, because this trophy is all that will be left of your glory when you''re gone.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10168,'en','Ponch polished his boots every morning before mounting his Dragoturkey and leaving on missions to save widows and orphans. Especially widows... Ponch was quite the charmer.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10169,'en','Ponch proudly wore this shield as he sat mounted on his Dragoturkey and ensured the safety of the streets of Bonta.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10170,'en','This helmet will protect the skull of its wearer should they fall off a Dragoturkey. It also makes you look like an idiot, even if you aren''t one.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10171,'en','These leather fingerless gloves are perfect for dishing out a first-class spanking.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10172,'en','This amulet will feed a vorpal slug for two days, or three days if it accompanied by a puree of your head.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10173,'en','The soles of these boots are covered with a sticky slime and the interior is filled with a slippery slime. At least it''s not the other way round.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10174,'en','The pores of this cape exude a sticky slime. You''ll look classy if you lie on your back and let it carry you along the floor.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10175,'en','This slimy, dripping helmet will nourish your scalp and keep your hair shiny, if not healthy. The two eyes attached to the top can be connected to your skull if you agree to have the nerve endings inserted into your ears.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10180,'en','This medallion acts as the key to a mysterious, forgotten city.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10181,'en','This ring was found in a mysterious city where nobody knew of its existence until they began frantically searching for it.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10182,'en','This shield will reflect the sun right into the eyes of your opponent. Instead of dazzling them with your blinding wit, blind them with this dazzling shi...eld.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10183,'en','This mask will capture the sunlight and concentrate it on your face so you can stay nice and brown all year round, even if you live to the North of Amakna.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10184,'en','Noke loved to put on this mask and hide in the woods to terrify lost ramblers. She died a long time ago after seeing her reflection in a puddle.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10185,'en','Noke dreamt of becoming a big, bad wolf. Sadly, with this cloak on her shoulders, she was more like one of the three little pigs.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10186,'en','This boar-tooth necklace will terrify boars, and by extension, your mother-in-law.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10187,'en','A long time ago, there was an aggressive boar that dreamt of becoming a stag. These daggers were used to carve it up.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10188,'en','This helmet has a very useful device which helps you translate the Oxon language. It''s also soundproof.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10189,'en','This ring used to belong to the Oxon King. He liked to play with the sunbeams reflecting on the ring and used to say "Watch out for the Oxon Laser!''"');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10190,'en','Don''t forget to put these boots on when you have your heads in the clouds, they''ll keep you high. Even though they''re cool, don''t wear them to go dancing if you want to keep your feet on the ground.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10191,'en','This belt is perfect when you need to rest and digest your granny''s Oxo Bucco.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10223,'en','This shovel is primarily intended for medical use, despite being used very controversially by the Enutrof known as Resat as a weapon of self defence.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10414,'en','To celebrate the birthday of an illustrious queen, a feast is held. This crown is usually worn on the day of the feast. Its magic is very powerful, and it can change the colour of the person who wears it to orange.  
This will make it easier to hide among people dressed in this colour.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10544,'en','This creature from elsewhere was tamed by its former master to only eat blop monsters. This may explain its strange appearance and its Blop''s breath.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10000047,'en','This creature from elsewhere was tamed by its former master to only eat blop monsters. This may explain its strange appearance and its Blop''s breath.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10552,'en','This headwear will keep your ears protected from cold and bad jokes.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10553,'en','Only a Gobbowl player would come up with the crazy idea of disguising themselves as a Tofu to intimidate their opponent. Mind you, this helmet''s aerodynamic shape allows the wearer to slice through the air like a missile. Maybe it''s not such a crazy idea after all. Well, whatever, you''ll certainly stand out from the crowd.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10554,'en','It''s the integrated red sunglasses that make this the helmet of choice for any self-respecting Lamechester United player.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10555,'en','This imposing shield bears the marks of many a Gobbowl match. However, despite its robust, intimidating appearance, it''d be of no use at all in a real fight. You''d be better off using it to play peek-a-boo with Gobblies.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10556,'en','This imposing shield perfectly sums up today''s youth: style over substance - all bark, and no bite. It''d be good for nothing in a real fight, unless your opponent was coming at you with a ball.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10557,'en','This battered old glove helps you catch Gobbowl balls, or any other round thing covered in wool, for that matter. What you do with it as result concerns you, and you only...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10558,'en','With this glove on your hand, you can pretend you''re a famous Gobbowl player when you''re playing fetch with your BowWow.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10559,'en','Gobbowl matches are brutal, and this belt was designed to protect players from muscular blows. However, you can also use it as a life-belt when you''re taking a bath. Who''d have thought?');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10560,'en','They say that Gobbowl is a game for real men. This belt''s for real men too, with plenty of protective padding to soften low blows. It''s also great for training young Srams.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10561,'en','These boots have been around for a while, you can certainly smell that. Plant them on your feet and you''ll look just like a real Gobbowl player. Plant their crampons in the rump of a few Gobblies, and the fans will come flocking.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10562,'en','"Fashionable footwear feeds fascinated fan''s frenzy", reads the latest headline, and for once, the papers aren''t wrong. When properly polished, these boots help make it look like your opponent pushed you over, when in fact, you slipped. Congratulations! You''ve just learnt one of the basics of Gobbowl.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10622,'en','This sword allowed Grute the Bwork to cut his opponents'' nuts in two, which is usually enough to make anyone give up a fight. This magical weapon is still imbued with the personality of Grute. If you equip it, you may well become him.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10623,'en','Grute the Bwork wasn''t very smart. In fact, he was as thick as two short planks. Fortunately, traditional teaching methods work equally well on Bworks than on children. After a few well-deserved strokes of the cane over the years, Grute became a real little brute.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10624,'en','Those who have had to face Grute the Bwork will tell you, "Don''t bother aiming for the head, it''s empty". This advice also applies to all those who face Iops, Goblins or mothers-in-law.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10625,'en','Grute''s Boots give off such a pungent aroma that you''ll be able to knock your opponents out with one quick kick to their head. These boots were forbidden in combat situations by the Sufokia Convention a long time ago, a convention which, it has to be said, has saved many, many lives.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10626,'en','The life of a Chafer Foot Soldier is not as rosy as you''d think. Although I''m not sure you''ve ever thought about it. Iop knows I''ve never thought of it myself, the life of a good, long, tall, strong Chafer Foot Soldier like Koksiks. In fact, I often lie awake at night, not thinking of the life of a Chafer Foot Soldier. Wonderful lads.
Anyway, enough of that. This sword is still infused with the spirit of Koksiks, and by equipping it, you could become him.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10627,'en','This ring belonged to Koksiks himself, and a lovely ring it is too. He let me have it once... but took it back some months later. Ahh. When I think of it now...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10628,'en','You should have seen Koksiks go in these boots. A sight to behold he was. Dancing. We danced once, but that was... a long time ago.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10629,'en','Chafer Koksiks the infantryman had two dreams in life: to climb Crackler mountain and to become a full-time minstrel. Life was very cruel to him - he ended up playing support for Jon Lemon... who made his name, and his entire career, playing unpaid charity gigs.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10630,'en','This staff looks very much like a lance... in fact, Goboff the Goblin used it to cut the tops off his boiled Giant Tofu eggs, back when the birds existed. What he used for toast soldiers is anyone''s guess. 
This magic weapon is still imbued with the spirit of Goboff. If you equip it, you could perhaps become him.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10631,'en','A popular saying amongst Goblins is "Sometimes you get the bear, sometimes the bear gets you". If you look at Goblins closely, this saying is better summarised as "Sometimes the bear gets you".');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10632,'en','Goboff the Goblin loved to gobble rotten eggs. His digestive tract might have been able to deal with this atrocious habit, but those unlucky enough to get a whiff of his foul breath weren''t, and fell like Moskitoes. Those unlucky enough not to be rendered unconscious immediately would grab onto this belt to stop themselves hitting the floor.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10633,'en','Goboff the Goblin was a keen gardener. He loved nothing more than whacking trespassers around the head with his rake. He found this ring on the finger of an impudent rambler who''d dared to trample his Salad leaves.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10634,'en','Kanniball Lektor used this weapon to hunt his prey, and send a few arrows his children''s'' way when he was in a playful mood. This magic weapon is still imbued with the spirit of Kanniball Lektor. If you equip it, you could perhaps become him.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10635,'en','When the two small balls attached to this amulet collide, they produce a slight rattling noise, which means a Kanniball is very close by. When you hear this noise, it is usually too late to escape, but there is still time to choose which sauce you want to be devoured with.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10636,'en','The ring is infused with secret spices, used for flavouring broth when stirred by hand. The spices are so good that once you put the ring on, there''s a real risk you''ll bite your own fingers off, they''ll be that tasty.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10637,'en','Kanniball Lektor wore these boots for several years before trading them in for a tourist on Moon Island. Look, he was hungry, alright?');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10638,'en','Pandit Stroy Zemol used to hit his adversaries with the flat of this weapon''s blade in order to knock them out without causing a scratch. Cursed for years with taunts about his name, the Pandit did not want to destroy them all, just render them unconscious for a while. This weapon is still infused with the spirit of Stroy Zemol, and by equipping it, you could become him.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10639,'en','Stroy Zemol had a sister, Faye Pworme. She liked travelling alone and exploring dark, foul-smelling tunnels.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10640,'en','This belt is allegedly reversible, only no one''s ever dared try it as they don''t want to be the first to discover that it isn''t actually reversible.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10641,'en','Stroy Zemol made these boots himself, from a few blocks of wood and a little bit of fabric. They might not look like other boots, but blimey, they''re certainly magical nevertheless.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10642,'en','Fyred Ampe the Dark Miner used this pickaxe to carve out the famous bottomless Kruup mine, in which Gaddie lived for several years. This weapon is still impregnated with the spirit of Fyred Ampe. By equipping it, you could become him.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10643,'en','When it comes into contact with warm, sticky liquids, this ring changes colour, which explains why Fyred Ampe the Dark Miner loved it so much.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10644,'en','The soles of these magic boots magic allow you to shatter blocks of coal by vibrating at its resonant frequency (look it up). The user guide indicates that they are even able to vibrate on their own when Slamdance music is played nearby.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10645,'en','This belt, reinforced with several different metals, was strong enough to support the weight of Fyred Ampe the Dark Miner''s enormous sack. Don''t worry, though, it should be just as useful for tiny packets too.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10646,'en','Boo');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10657,'en','This strange pet is the result of cross-breeding Amakna''s greatest truffle hunters. Its enormous snout allows it to locate Ogrine, even if it is hidden underwater. It took Otomai several years to create this beast. It is said he used it to find something he thought he''d lost, something that had escaped from him. In doing so, he fixed one of his many mistakes. 
No one knows for sure. What is certain is the process of hunting Ogrine is so complicated and uses so much energy, that this creature is obliged to eat monster souls to develop. It was raised on the beaches of Otomai''s Island and will only eat the souls of the creatures that live there.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10685,'en','Equipped with this golden helmet, your head will soon be up for auction and worth its weight in gold.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10686,'en','This fabric cloak, coated with a thin layer of gold, is magical. It attracts attention and reflects light directly into the pupils of dishonest types who try to stab you from behind. Indispensable if you have Sram friends.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10687,'en','This ring is so heavy that it greatly increases the inertia of your fist when you distribute blows to your opponents. When you begin punishing peasants, it will be virtually impossible to stop you.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10688,'en','This belt is perfect to hang your gold bars around your waist, they''ll pass unnoticed.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10784,'en','No one has a clue what powers this amulet brings, but everyone knows what it takes away: your credibility.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10785,'en','You''ve heard of the game "Pick it, lick it, roll it, flick it", right? Well this ring will protect you from the flicked stuff.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10794,'en','Warm on the inside and cold on the outside, these boots will let you kick snowmen''s arses without melting their pert little buttocks.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10797,'en','Unsheathed from its scabbard, this sword can cut ham, Enutrofs, one-legged men, dancers and one-legged, Enutrof dancers wrapped in a slice of ham. Sadly though, it''s useless for killing monsters.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10798,'en','This shield won''t protect you from your own stupidity.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10799,'en','Having problems hiding your dagger in your underwear? No problem, you can wedge it between your love handles and this belt.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10800,'en','You''ll be able to fly with this cape around your shoulders. Just close your eyes, clench your fists, open your mouth, stretch out your arms and jump off a cliff shouting "I can fly!". Moments later, you''ll wake up with two broken legs.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10801,'en','This shoddy hat admirably hides your baldness. Unfortunately, it''s not big enough to hide your false modesty.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10802,'en','More golden than a Black Dragoone, less pink than a Pink Dragoone, and rarer than a Skeleton Dragoone, this pet will draw all eyes towards you, even if you''re as ugly as a Piwi. This soul-devourer will only eat the Dopples that can be found in class temples.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10000045,'en','More golden than a Black Dragoone, less pink than a Pink Dragoone, and rarer than a Skeleton Dragoone, this pet will draw all eyes towards you, even if you''re as ugly as a Piwi. This soul-devourer will only eat the Dopples that can be found in class temples.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10818,'en','With this basic-looking weapon, you''ll feel like you know how to fight.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10828,'en','They say sticks and stones may break your bones, but names will never hurt you. With this helmet on, you''ll certainly challenge that misconception...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10830,'en','Is that a Banana Cape in your pocket or are you just pleased to see me?');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10834,'en','It doesn''t take much to make you look like an Ouginak. Watch out for fleas.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10836,'en','You wear this amulet proudly, as a symbol of your participation in this great sporting event. You need it to stay proud having been through a scrum with B.C. Trool.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10846,'en','Driven into a strange frenzy, any Tofus that you meet will want to rub up against your leg. Are you sure it''s the cape that attracts them?');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10847,'en','Hulkrap slipped these comfortable boots on to his ample feet once a year, but he took them off every day, which suggests they might be magic.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10848,'en','These boots can also be used as anvils. Their former owner urges you not to dance while wearing them.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10849,'en','This belt is constructed around a magnetic metal frame which attracts the purses of those careless enough to rub up against you.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10850,'en','Klume had three weaknesses: Arachnees, being tickled, and tickly Arachnees.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10851,'en','This belt is still covered in flour, perhaps because Kloug the Dark Baker used it as an apron. Mind you, it might not be flour, it could be the powder he uses to soothe his embarrassing rash.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10852,'en','Hulkrap stole this amulet from Ted Gonztipay, an anally retentive goblin with absolutely no sense of humour whatsoever.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10853,'en','This amulet allows you to knead the skin on your neck without using your hands.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10854,'en','Gontran Klume the smith traded a sword belonging to Dame Antium for this ring.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10855,'en','This ring has been dipped in a multitude of different yeasts. It is said that it is capable of transforming those who wear it into mould. Some adventurers don''t see any difference after slipping it on.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10856,'en','Hulkrap was a terrible bandit riddled with remorse, and felt obliged to give back what he''d stolen. This magical weapon is still imbued with the soul of Hulkrap the Bandit. You may be able to become him if you equip it.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10857,'en','This hammer was used to forge a Kriptonit zipper for Captain Chafer. This magical weapon is still imbued with the spirit of the Dark Smith Klume. By equipping it, you may be able to embody him.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10858,'en','Kloug liked to make himself appear generous by handing out bread to those who dared to speak to him. He used this wand to judge and punish the innocent. This weapon is still imbued with the magic of the Kloug the Dark Baker. You may be able to successfully embody him by equipping this weapon.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10863,'en','Tarzantula is incredibly badly behaved, she jumps around everywhere, she screams all the time, she bites anyone she meets - but you love her all the same, even though you don''t know why. Mother Nature blessed her with a ferocious appetite, and so this soul eater loves devouring Moskitoes and Larvae.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10000068,'en','Tarzantula is incredibly badly behaved, she jumps around everywhere, she screams all the time, she bites anyone she meets - but you love her all the same, even though you don''t know why. Mother Nature blessed her with a ferocious appetite, and so this soul eater loves devouring Moskitoes and Larvae.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10864,'en','This unique Mush Mush was raised by a pack of Boowolves, which still doesn''t explain why he has such hairy armpits. This soul eater loves seafood, and as such, will only eat beach creatures.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10000064,'en','This unique Mush Mush was raised by a pack of Boowolves, which still doesn''t explain why he has such hairy armpits. This soul eater loves seafood, and as such, will only eat beach creatures.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10865,'en','This Tofu was struck by lightning 11 times while she was growing up. She''ll give you an electric shock if you stroke her, and she''ll give you an electric shock if you don''t stroke her. It''s up to you to choose. This soul eater detests rats, and so will jump at the chance to devour them if they''re available.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10866,'en','Sting the Prespic loves artichoke hearts smothered in Bherb Blood, endives with Pikoko Hair, and the songs of Jon Lemon. He seems to enjoy your company as well. This soul eater is quite fussy about the creatures he eats, however, and only likes the taste of creatures from the Dark Jungle.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10000067,'en','Sting the Prespic loves artichoke hearts smothered in Bherb Blood, endives with Pikoko Hair, and the songs of Jon Lemon. He seems to enjoy your company as well. This soul eater is quite fussy about the creatures he eats, however, and only likes the taste of creatures from the Dark Jungle.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10899,'en','The Manitou Zoth was a former stevedore - he moved problems instead of solving them. In spite of that, the Zoth community were scared of him because he shouted louder than all the others, which was enough to make him the Zoth chief. This staff is still animated by his spirit. You may be able to successfully embody it if you equip this weapon.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10904,'en','You won this amulet thanks to your incomparable capacity for breaking eggs without making an omelette.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10906,'en','Fashioned from one of Grozilla''s scales, this is a heavy shield of exceptional stature. Only rare and fearsome fighters may proudly wear it.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10907,'en','Well, there you are. You did it: took part in the greatest Dragonic birth-control exercise ever. As a result, you''re going to have to eat omelette for weeks to come.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10922,'en','This shield shows all other adventurers that you were a pioneer in establishing your profession.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10923,'en','This shield shows all other adventurers that you were a pioneer in establishing your profession.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10924,'en','This shield shows all other adventurers that you were a pioneer in establishing your profession.');
