INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11496,'en','This familiar-looking headgear was enchanted by Hel Munster himself after a famous Astrubian fashion designer wouldn''t stop asking him. He wanted to offer a collection that adjusted to the colours of the person wearing it. Despite its being discoloured by a top-secret process, you can still recognise the unmistakable smell of Boowolf slobber emanating from it... Yuck!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11497,'en','This familiar-looking headgear was enchanted by Hel Munster himself after a famous Astrubian fashion designer wouldn''t stop asking him. He wanted to offer a collection that adjusted to the colours of the person wearing it. Despite its being discoloured by a top-secret process, you can still recognise the unmistakable smell of Boowolf slobber emanating from it... Yuck!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11539,'en','This bow was made from high-quality materials. When grasped, it gives off incredible power, which can also be felt in the arrows it shoots.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11542,'en','When you don these duds, you should expect a noticeable increase in ambushes and other attacks of all kinds by assailants from the Black City. Perhaps, deep down, you really do want all the extra attention.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11543,'en','This ring was touted as a unique, one-of-a-kind item that would confer you with powers coveted by dragoturkey riders dressed all in black. Scanning the crowds of adventurers in Bonta during rush hour is all it takes to reveal that this was a lie.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11544,'en','At first glance, this ring seems extremely uncomfortable to wear, even very dangerous for your tiny fingers. On second glance, your first glance was right.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11545,'en','This belt can, of course, hide your backside quite effectively. You can also wear it on your head as a jaunty cap during fancy parties.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11546,'en','Set with a demon eye, this originally shaped amulet will poke you whenever you start to run. Think of it as the demon''s revenge and a constant reminder that every action calls for a reaction.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11547,'en','These boots smell of sulphur and cheese. In addition to giving you power, they''ll mask your foot odour. What more could anyone want?');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11548,'en','Qu''Tan is said to have used these horns to punish his subjects when they came back from hunts with empty sacks.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11554,'en','Inspired by the iconic Armoured Dragoturkey, this rare Armoured Dragoone specimen is also looking to reach legendary status and could even steal the show from its older sibling!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10000003,'en','Inspired by the iconic Armoured Dragoturkey, this rare Armoured Dragoone specimen is also looking to reach legendary status and could even steal the show from its older sibling!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11555,'en','You won''t go unnoticed with this helmet on your head. True veterans will immediately see your worth, your unquestionable taste and the look of the famous Armoured Dragoturkey.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11556,'en','Forged from the same thick plating as that worn by the famous Armoured Dragoturkey, this shield will significantly slow down enemy attacks but not your fierce fervour.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11557,'en','It floats on air with the same magnificence as the Armoured Dragoturkey that inspired it. The Dragarmour Cloak will make you feel like you have wings. Just remember to come back down to earth when the fight starts.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11621,'en','Fashioned from one of Grozilla''s scales, this is a heavy shield of exceptional stature. Only rare and fearsome fighters may proudly wear it. What''s more, this one is especially colourful.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11702,'en','They say that this Dragoone got fed up with being compared to the pink buttocks of a female Bwork and wanted to set herself apart from her peers. So, she ran off to Moon Island to sunbathe in peace. Just look at her now! She''s taken on the colour of a real flaming dragon!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10000061,'en','They say that this Dragoone got fed up with being compared to the pink buttocks of a female Bwork and wanted to set herself apart from her peers. So, she ran off to Moon Island to sunbathe in peace. Just look at her now! She''s taken on the colour of a real flaming dragon!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11703,'en','This festive hat reminds you of a very odd dream you had two years ago. See there: you do have a good memory when you put your mind to it!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11708,'en','They make you giddy, occupying your thoughts night and day. Ogrines! Already as steadfast as the pet that can sniff them out from miles away, now you''ll be pleased to look like one.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11709,'en','As transparent as your intentions (namely, to dig up all the ogrines you can!), this striking accessory will show how much you love precious ogre tears. Plus, it has little bells on it.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11710,'en','Although made from real ogre tears, this shield won''t save you from one of those creatures. That said, it will protect you from their massive spittle if they sneeze.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11711,'en','A problem? A bug? A clever adventurer gave you 10% of your kamas? Don''t panic! No need to contact Ankama Support because the adorable Weegle Owl will be there to guide you and dry your tears throughout your adventures in the World of Twelve. (Place this pet over another, already-equipped pet to change its appearance.)');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10000082,'en','A problem? A bug? A clever adventurer gave you 10% of your kamas? Don''t panic! No need to contact Ankama Support because the adorable Weegle Owl will be there to guide you and dry your tears throughout your adventures in the World of Twelve. (Place this pet over another, already-equipped pet to change its appearance.)');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10000083,'en','A problem? A bug? A clever adventurer gave you 10% of your kamas? Don''t panic! No need to contact Ankama Support because the adorable Weegle Owl will be there to guide you and dry your tears throughout your adventures in the World of Twelve. (Place this pet over another, already-equipped pet to change its appearance.)');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10000084,'en','A problem? A bug? A clever adventurer gave you 10% of your kamas? Don''t panic! No need to contact Ankama Support because the adorable Weegle Owl will be there to guide you and dry your tears throughout your adventures in the World of Twelve. (Place this pet over another, already-equipped pet to change its appearance.)');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10000085,'en','A problem? A bug? A clever adventurer gave you 10% of your kamas? Don''t panic! No need to contact Ankama Support because the adorable Weegle Owl will be there to guide you and dry your tears throughout your adventures in the World of Twelve. (Place this pet over another, already-equipped pet to change its appearance.)');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11712,'en','No pirate has ever managed to touch this magnificent three-cornered hat during a sword fight thanks to its wearers'' agility and flexibility. If, however, it were ever to receive even the tiniest scratch (heaven forbid!), the wearer will be cursed to the end of their days and no longer worthy of wearing it.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11713,'en','This Pirate Coat, nicknamed the "Thousand Battle Trophy", symbolises the astounding feat of having triumphed in at least that many sea battles. Best to think twice before attacking a pirate of such renown! Rumour has it that wearing this coat before accomplishing that feat will make you horrifically seasick... Sailors, take heed!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11714,'en','Is it a shield? Or a sheath? Or both at once? This splendid and versatile Pirate Shield lets you block your opponents'' most fearsome blows and store your sharpest weapons.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11715,'en','This adorable creature''s hairiness seems to hinder its vision. Beloved by buccaneers of all stripes, it views you as one of its most distinguished representatives. We did tell you it had trouble seeing. This soul eater only eats Pirates.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11717,'en','Let''s just say that under this hat, you''ll find anything but gifts.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11719,'en','Do you hear those jingling bells? Those crunching footsteps in the snow? It''s Kwismas, and this pet is here to remind you of that!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10000049,'en','Do you hear those jingling bells? Those crunching footsteps in the snow? It''s Kwismas, and this pet is here to remind you of that!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11724,'en','After snowploughing straight from the Icefields, this shield will show off your prowess as a novice skier from Kwismas Island.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11725,'en','When you wear this backpack, you aren''t just carrying a simple backpack: you''re carrying a simple backpack that is carrying a simple pair of skis.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11726,'en','"Adventurer, whether you''re in town or rushing down the slopes, your ears will never get cold with this cap." Hard to believe the slogan when your ears aren''t completely covered, but whatever... They claim it''s true: satisfaction guaranteed or your money back!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11727,'en','The Solar Bear has always been loyal to Father Kwismas, and he''ll be loyal to you too. Thanks to its thick, downy coat, you''ll never get cold, even on the iciest islands. Rub his belly once in a while to warm up his body.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11729,'en','Don''t trust that cute little face – Shushus are usually bloodthirsty, terrifying and cruel. So it''s probably a bad idea to snuggle up to this pet for comfort on those long winter nights. It''s impossible to say which body part you''ll lose if you do.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11732,'en','Anyone who equips the Wicked Shield will have a wicked time. Those were the words of Halden the Sram when he brought down the Kwismas Minotoball that was terrorising Amakna Village.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11733,'en','Hold it high and proud, because this trophy is all that will be left of your glory when you''re gone.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11734,'en','Hold it high and proud, because this trophy is all that will be left of your glory when you''re gone.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11735,'en','Hold it high and proud, because this trophy is all that will be left of your glory when you''re gone.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11747,'en','This headgear symbolises love. Love of war. Love of hearing your victims cry out in pain. Love of crushing those weaker than you. In short, the unconditional love that all Iops (whether by birth or conviction) have for battle with a capital "B" as in "brawling". Romantic, isn''t it?');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11748,'en','Wearing a cape always does a bang up job of adding a classy – even heroic – touch to any look, don''t you think? Well... except when you get your feet all tangled up in it or a gust of wind blows it over your head, that is. But, hey, fashion hurts. Make an effort!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11749,'en','Iops who know how to use their heads for than just bash ups will notice the nuances of this shield. It offers its owner protection, yes. But, thanks to its finely honed blades, it can also slice lousy pig sausage into perfect bite-sized bits. Clever... As an added bash-up bonus, it''ll give your enemies nasty booboos.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11750,'en','When you burst a blood vessel, things quickly start to get messy. On top of quenching your thirst for victory, this shield will shed your opponents'' blood while protecting you from any splatters. Pretty handy, right? And it looks great in red too.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11751,'en','Kings of trickery and queens of the poker face: this chameleon shield is for those whose intentions are impossible to read. Got a knack for dealing from the bottom of the deck? Able to dodge an attack while sowing doubt in your opponent''s mind? With this shield, you''ll have yet another ace up your sleeve.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11752,'en','A wrap for those who''ll object to anything, before hiding so they can more easily blame their neighbor. Clever...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11753,'en','Inspired by none other than the Pandora Master, this cloak is so wicked that it can stab its owner in the back. How beautifully deceitful...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11754,'en','This shield will signal to your enemy that you''ll put ''em in a corner if they don''t respect your ideals.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11755,'en','This pet will defend you better than anyone. It''ll even defend you better than you ever would. Needless to say, it''ll defend itself better than you could defend it. And apparently, it can even defend your own beliefs better than you. In other words, obviously, anyone would look pretty pathetic next to this little armed panda (including you – but if it''s saving your hide, what does it matter). This soul eater only eats Pandits.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10000058,'en','This pet will defend you better than anyone. It''ll even defend you better than you ever would. Needless to say, it''ll defend itself better than you could defend it. And apparently, it can even defend your own beliefs better than you. In other words, obviously, anyone would look pretty pathetic next to this little armed panda (including you – but if it''s saving your hide, what does it matter). This soul eater only eats Pandits.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11756,'en','The workings of time can be so mysterious in that a 2-hour family dinner will feel like an eternity, whereas a 20-minute game of Five-Cat Monte seems to go by much faster. With a shield that''s sharpish, at least one thing will be consistent: It''ll sting, and your enemies will rest in Externam for all time...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11757,'en','Dyed-in-the-wool protectors – those prepared to sacrifice anything and take a beating to save someone''s life – will understand: certain aggressive attacks warrant a response on another scale. As a barrier, the Aegishield is virtually impossible to get past. It can cover your rear... plus your front and your side, which is well appreciated!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11758,'en','The crowning glory of this set is its headgear, which makes you look cool, calm, collected and harmless... Then, wham! You attack! (I''m sure you get the idea...)');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11759,'en','Even older than Gwandpa Wabbit himself, who got it from his great great aunt, this cape is unparalleled at resisting the test of time.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11760,'en','Make no mistake – the hole smack-dab in the middle of the shield is strategic! It''s there so you can see your opponents coming before you run away.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11766,'en','With this cap equipped, Ecaflip''s luck will always smile upon you. Or not! Who knows? And besides... It''s not like an adventurer ever got rich just by wearing a cap shaped like a piggy bank.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11771,'en','Enough sugar to give a Trool diabetes.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11772,'en','If you lumber along with this on your head, some might think you''re trying to hide evidence of last night''s liquid adventures. True or not, at least people will leave you alone.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11773,'en','They say that anyone who tries to give you a wooden overcoat while you''re wearing this cape is likely to end up wearing the overcoat in your place. Wood you like us to help you test it?');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11774,'en','Even though you''re not out of the woods yet, this shield will help you stand up to anything.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11775,'en','A tiny, stoic warrior, Minipoth has only one expression. Cuddles leave him indifferent. Nag him because he didn''t clear the table, he''s still indifferent. Threaten to abandon him, he just shrugs... It can be a bit destabilising. 
Yet, you need to understand that all these signs are... err, that one sign is... just his way of showing you that he loves you more than anything.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10000056,'en','A tiny, stoic warrior, Minipoth has only one expression. Cuddles leave him indifferent. Nag him because he didn''t clear the table, he''s still indifferent. Threaten to abandon him, he just shrugs... It can be a bit destabilising. 
Yet, you need to understand that all these signs are... err, that one sign is... just his way of showing you that he loves you more than anything.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11781,'en','A little pet driven by grand values. Are you sure you''re worthy...? All right, jeez, we were just teasing');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10000024,'en','A little pet driven by grand values. Are you sure you''re worthy...? All right, jeez, we were just teasing');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10000025,'en','A little pet driven by grand values. Are you sure you''re worthy...? All right, jeez, we were just teasing');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10000026,'en','A little pet driven by grand values. Are you sure you''re worthy...? All right, jeez, we were just teasing');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10000027,'en','A little pet driven by grand values. Are you sure you''re worthy...? All right, jeez, we were just teasing');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10000028,'en','A little pet driven by grand values. Are you sure you''re worthy...? All right, jeez, we were just teasing');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11804,'en','After years of watching his children get eaten on Moon Island, Iop decided to buck the trend and tame the Greedovore. It looks cute and cuddly, but feeds on its kind... Still, that''s better than feeding on Iops! This ravenous soul chewer will feed off the remains of creatures from Moon Island.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11809,'en','Isn''t he cute? Armed to the teeth, of course. But could you expect anything less from one of Iop''s little allies? In any case, you''re now his proud owner so have fun: show him what a real brawl is like!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10000034,'en','Isn''t he cute? Armed to the teeth, of course. But could you expect anything less from one of Iop''s little allies? In any case, you''re now his proud owner so have fun: show him what a real brawl is like!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10000035,'en','Isn''t he cute? Armed to the teeth, of course. But could you expect anything less from one of Iop''s little allies? In any case, you''re now his proud owner so have fun: show him what a real brawl is like!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10000036,'en','Isn''t he cute? Armed to the teeth, of course. But could you expect anything less from one of Iop''s little allies? In any case, you''re now his proud owner so have fun: show him what a real brawl is like!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10000037,'en','Isn''t he cute? Armed to the teeth, of course. But could you expect anything less from one of Iop''s little allies? In any case, you''re now his proud owner so have fun: show him what a real brawl is like!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(10000038,'en','Isn''t he cute? Armed to the teeth, of course. But could you expect anything less from one of Iop''s little allies? In any case, you''re now his proud owner so have fun: show him what a real brawl is like!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(11812,'en','Osamodas sometimes bares his teeth and claws, so it''s entirely normal that he''d shake his tusks at you ("tusk, tusk, tusk") in defence. To some, this shield looks like a furious lousy pig. Others think it looks like a charging minotoror. Most just away without asking any questions.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12150,'en','This shield both protects you and covers you in glory. Defence might not be Iop''s favourite strategy but even he admits that it can come in handy – sometimes.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12650,'en','A sword worthy of your feats of prowess with weapons during Iop''s banquet. Despite what their god thinks, it''s probably sharper than your Iop friends.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12651,'en','This medal rewards you for your efforts. Iop has noticed that brawling''s your thing and wanted to give it to you to encourage you to continue in his footsteps.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12652,'en','With this band, your fist is also a weapon. According to Iop, one must always be ready to fight... even when you''ve left your sword at the inn.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12653,'en','With this ring, your fist is also a weapon. According to Iop, one must always be ready to fight... even when you''ve left your sword at the inn.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12654,'en','Robust boots reinforced with precious metal to kick your opponents'' backsides most efficiently.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12655,'en','A sword worthy of your feats of prowess with weapons during Iop''s banquet. Despite what their god thinks, it''s probably sharper than your Iop friends.');
