INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12728,'en','With this ring, your fist is also a weapon. According to Iop, one must always be ready to fight... even when you''ve left your sword at the inn.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12729,'en','Robust boots reinforced with precious metal to kick your opponents'' backsides most efficiently.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12732,'en','With this dark, bandana-like headgear, even the cutest Eniripsa looks threatening. Just imagine what it''ll do for you!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12733,'en','The advantage of the White Chafers'' cape is scaring your opponents even when they''re behind you!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12734,'en','If they stare too long at this shield, gobbowlers on the opposing team are hypnotised by its troubling beauty... to the point that they forget to play.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12746,'en','Certain opponents won''t leave you alone for a second once they''ve got you in their sights. The best way to get rid of them is to let them attack you head-on. Or at least, to make them think that''s what''s happening... This shield will have them believing they''ve hit their target head-on, when in fact they were never anywhere close. And that''s when you move in for the kill! They''ll never know what hit ''em!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12747,'en','Don''t trust that cute little face – Shushus are usually bloodthirsty, terrifying and cruel. So it''s probably a bad idea to snuggle up to this pet for comfort on those long winter nights. It''s impossible to say which body part you''ll lose if you do.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12753,'en','Robust construction and elegant design combine in this chrome-alloy helmet forged in a little town whose name is a carefully guarded secret. Let''s hope that the artisan who crafted this extraordinary piece was paid handsomely for their work.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12754,'en','It''s easy to recognise a noble and valiant paladin, even far away and from behind. Unless he''s forgotten his cloak that day. Then it''s a little tricky.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12755,'en','Finely forged from an exceptionally thick metal, this impenetrable shield is nevertheless extremely light. But don''t tell anyone that - just let them think you''ve been working out a lot.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12756,'en','To make sure he''d remember exactly where he stashed his last pile of loot, Enutrof came up with a long series of clever plans. But after about ten or so, his creativity started to fail him. So he just marked an X on a map and pinned it on an old plank somewhere that no one would find it. Of course, now he can''t find it either. So until he figures out that the old board is now your new shield, could you make sure his map doesn''t get damaged? Just don''t let any weapons or projectiles hit it, and you''ll be fine.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12757,'en','True warriors will do whatever it takes to win. For good luck, some carry a wabbit''s paw in their pocket. Others never go into battle without their favourite old coat of mail... despite the stench. But real champions know that when it comes to whipping up a wicked spell, nothing beats a talisman ritually prepared by a Sadida sorcerer. Like this Gris-Gris Shield, for instance.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12758,'en','When the sun''s out all day, every day, your skin is exposed to dangerous levels of ultra-violent (UV) radiation. And that''s not good! Because you have this incredibly disgusting habit of peeling off your scorched skin the next day, trying to see how big a piece you can get. Just... ugh. So for your own sake and (especially) ours: when you go out this summer, always bring your SPF Shield.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12759,'en','Every year, hundreds of summer revellers lose their eyesight to excessive sun exposure. Make sure you''re not one of them! This year, try wearing a pair of our Shunglasses. Equipped with a unique light-shunning technology, the lenses inside won''t let you see further, or closer up, or more clearly either. But! What they will do is transform day into night, correcting the exaggerated brightness of the sun and saving your eyeballs from potentially dangerous overheating.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12760,'en','Every season of the year has its own unique charms. The same goes for the many cloaks to be found in the World of Twelve. But if you ask us... summer definitely better than others! 
Right? Haha! Ha... (Hmph. Some people just have no sense of humour.)');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12761,'en','Out on the beach, he''s a real expert. Armed with his shovel, he fills his body with sand and seawater, then jumps out in front of you to turn around and form a lovely sandcastle. But Patrick will need your help to go back to normal – he tends to freak out a bit if he keeps his head down for too long.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12766,'en','Nothing can get past this shield: not arrows, not swords, not even insults and curses hurled your way. By what miracle, you ask? By the miracle of pure faith!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12767,'en','With its long points turned toward the heavens, this helmet is idea for making a spiritual connection with the gods, whether in a temple or on the battlefield. As long as the line isn''t busy...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12768,'en','With this finely embroidered cloak, all your guilt and regrets will billow harmlessly behind you, leaving your soul purified and serene when it''s time to fight.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12769,'en','This familiar-looking cloak was enchanted by Hel Munster himself after a famous Astrubian fashion designer wouldn''t stop asking him. He wanted to offer a collection that adjusted to the colours of the person wearing it. Despite its being discoloured by a top-secret process, you can still recognise the unmistakable smell of Boowolf slobber emanating from it... Yuck!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12770,'en','This familiar-looking cloak was enchanted by Hel Munster himself after a famous Astrubian fashion designer wouldn''t stop asking him. He wanted to offer a collection that adjusted to the colours of the person wearing it. Despite its being discoloured by a top-secret process, you can still recognise the unmistakable smell of Boowolf slobber emanating from it... Yuck!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12771,'en','This familiar-looking cloak was enchanted by Hel Munster himself after a famous Astrubian fashion designer wouldn''t stop asking him. He wanted to offer a collection that adjusted to the colours of the person wearing it. Despite its being discoloured by a top-secret process, you can still recognise the unmistakable smell of Boowolf slobber emanating from it... Yuck!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12772,'en','This familiar-looking cloak was enchanted by Hel Munster himself after a famous Astrubian fashion designer wouldn''t stop asking him. He wanted to offer a collection that adjusted to the colours of the person wearing it. Despite its being discoloured by a top-secret process, you can still recognise the unmistakable smell of Boowolf slobber emanating from it... Yuck!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12773,'en','This familiar-looking cloak was enchanted by Hel Munster himself after a famous Astrubian fashion designer wouldn''t stop asking him. He wanted to offer a collection that adjusted to the colours of the person wearing it. Despite its being discoloured by a top-secret process, you can still recognise the unmistakable smell of Boowolf slobber emanating from it... Yuck!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12775,'en','This familiar-looking headgear was enchanted by Hel Munster himself after a famous Astrubian fashion designer wouldn''t stop asking him. He wanted to offer a collection that adjusted to the colours of the person wearing it. Despite its being discoloured by a top-secret process, you can still recognise the unmistakable smell of Boowolf slobber emanating from it... Yuck!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12776,'en','This certificate authorizes you to pick up your mount at a stable.  
Warning! This certificate will only be valid for 20 days. Once this time limit is over, your mount will be sent back to the wild and your certificate will no longer be valid. You will not be able to reclaim your mount. Always leave your mount in a stable if you go away for a long time.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12780,'en','This certificate authorizes you to pick up your mount at a stable.  
Warning! This certificate will only be valid for 20 days. Once this time limit is over, your mount will be sent back to the wild and your certificate will no longer be valid. You will not be able to reclaim your mount. Always leave your mount in a stable if you go away for a long time.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12781,'en','They say that this shield repels evil spirits. You''ll say that no one''s actually asking it to do that. Is that so? That''s funny, because you''ll be glad to have it around when the ghost of your worst enemy pays you a visit at night to tickle your toes with a piwi feather.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12782,'en','This weapon was lent to you by Notend Less, who sees real potential in you... Well, to be honest, he mainly just sees you as some sort of "Trool Fair freak show". Not exactly a ringing endorsement. Still, it allows you to temporarily take on the properties of a class of your choosing, and that''s something, isn''t it?');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12783,'en','This weapon was lent to you by Notend Less, who sees real potential in you... Well, to be honest, he mainly just sees you as some sort of "Trool Fair freak show". Not exactly a ringing endorsement. Still, it allows you to temporarily take on the properties of a class of your choosing, and that''s something, isn''t it?');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12784,'en','This weapon was lent to you by Notend Less, who sees real potential in you... Well, to be honest, he mainly just sees you as some sort of "Trool Fair freak show". Not exactly a ringing endorsement. Still, it allows you to temporarily take on the properties of a class of your choosing, and that''s something, isn''t it?');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(12785,'en','This weapon was lent to you by Notend Less, who sees real potential in you... Well, to be honest, he mainly just sees you as some sort of "Trool Fair freak show". Not exactly a ringing endorsement. Still, it allows you to temporarily take on the properties of a class of your choosing, and that''s something, isn''t it?');
