INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13212,'de','Diese Waffe wurde euch von Notend Less geliehen, der Potenzial in euch sieht ... Gut, in Wahrheit war er vielmehr an euch als „Jahrmarktattraktion“ interessiert. Nicht gerade lobend. Jedenfalls erhaltet ihr damit vorübergehend die Eigenschaften einer Klasse, und das ist gar nicht mal übel.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13213,'de','Diese Waffe wurde euch von Notend Less geliehen, der Potenzial in euch sieht ... Gut, in Wahrheit war er vielmehr an euch als „Jahrmarktattraktion“ interessiert. Nicht gerade lobend. Jedenfalls erhaltet ihr damit vorübergehend die Eigenschaften einer Klasse, und das ist gar nicht mal übel.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13214,'de','Diese Waffe wurde euch von Notend Less geliehen, der Potenzial in euch sieht ... Gut, in Wahrheit war er vielmehr an euch als „Jahrmarktattraktion“ interessiert. Nicht gerade lobend. Jedenfalls erhaltet ihr damit vorübergehend die Eigenschaften einer Klasse, und das ist gar nicht mal übel.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13215,'de','Diese Waffe wurde euch von Notend Less geliehen, der Potenzial in euch sieht ... Gut, in Wahrheit war er vielmehr an euch als „Jahrmarktattraktion“ interessiert. Nicht gerade lobend. Jedenfalls erhaltet ihr damit vorübergehend die Eigenschaften einer Klasse, und das ist gar nicht mal übel.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13216,'de','Diese Waffe wurde euch von Notend Less geliehen, der Potenzial in euch sieht ... Gut, in Wahrheit war er vielmehr an euch als „Jahrmarktattraktion“ interessiert. Nicht gerade lobend. Jedenfalls erhaltet ihr damit vorübergehend die Eigenschaften einer Klasse, und das ist gar nicht mal übel.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13218,'de','The Galeapagos is a pet with a reputation for betrayal. He easily makes temporary alliances with other guests, but just as easily betrays them when it''s to his advantage to do so.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13219,'de','The Troolex Sagum is a cape made from weapons abandoned during combat by adventurers who fall under the blows of their opponents in the Gladiatrool arena. Made from a woven net with a cleverly integrated trident, it''s the perfect mix of style and bravado. It won''t help one bit with keeping you warm, though!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13220,'de','The Troolex Galea, created by Notend Less himself, is much more than mere headgear. It gives its wearer unparalleled class, both inside the Gladiatrool arena and outside it. This piece of armour is only available to those who triumph in the Gladiatrool arena after many fights.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13222,'de','If you take this certificate to a stable, you will be able to collect your mount.
It is important to remember that it is only valid for 20 days. Once this time is up, the mount will be returned to the wild and the certificate will be invalidated, and you will no longer be able to collect your mount. Always leave your mount in a stable if you go away for a long time.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13224,'de','Don''t look him in the eyes, you fool! You''ll end up scratching behind your ear with your foot. Or worse...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13225,'de','Fluttering in the wind makes this cape look magical, not to mention the unique wand that must glow in the dark (at the very least) if you know what to do with it.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13226,'de','A mage just isn''t a proper mage without a hood to make them appear dark and brooding, for a showy entrance wherever they go. This one even shows off your eyes!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13227,'de','These ancestral motifs must contain powerful magic. And such transparency! Have you ever felt this hidden before? You''ve got four hours.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13228,'de','Despite appearances, this little critter knows no pity, no empathy. But it does inspire pity and empathy in others, which helps offset your indifference.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13229,'de','This alloy of leather and iron will make everyone think you''re not really human and have an eye in the back of your head. Hmm... Almost makes you seem more threatening from behind...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13230,'de','You''ve really stepped up your look with this top hat with integrated glasses and a filtering mask. Watch out you don''t inhale too much Stasis, though!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13231,'de','Ever since you slipped on this huge glove, people have listened more when you pound your fist on the table. What''s that? Oh, right... And when you hit your enemies, too.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13233,'de','This magnificent shield shaped like a Kwismas snow globe is just perfect for those who want to save their skins AND spread holiday cheer. WARNING: Shaking this shield can make your opponents as irritable as the grumpiest of grinches.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13234,'de','Haltet diesen Schild stolz ins Licht, damit jeder ihn sehen kann. Denn wenn ihr umkommt, wird dies die letzte Erinnerung an eure großen Heldentaten bleiben.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13235,'de','Haltet diesen Schild stolz ins Licht, damit jeder ihn sehen kann. Denn wenn ihr umkommt, wird dies die letzte Erinnerung an eure großen Heldentaten bleiben.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13236,'de','Haltet diesen Schild stolz ins Licht, damit jeder ihn sehen kann. Denn wenn ihr umkommt, wird dies die letzte Erinnerung an eure großen Heldentaten bleiben.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13237,'de','Haltet diesen Schild stolz ins Licht, damit jeder ihn sehen kann. Denn wenn ihr umkommt, wird dies die letzte Erinnerung an eure großen Heldentaten bleiben.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13240,'de','Congratulations! You are the proud owner of a Hidweg. This bird has the amazing ability to deliver your mail whilst also getting rid of bad news. If you''re drowning in unpaid bills and unwanted ads, Hidweg will make them vanish into thin air, leaving only that which will brighten your day.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13241,'de','Haltet diesen Schild stolz ins Licht, damit jeder ihn sehen kann. Denn wenn ihr umkommt, wird dies die letzte Erinnerung an eure großen Heldentaten bleiben.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13242,'de','Haltet diesen Schild stolz ins Licht, damit jeder ihn sehen kann. Denn wenn ihr umkommt, wird dies die letzte Erinnerung an eure großen Heldentaten bleiben.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13243,'de','Haltet diesen Schild stolz ins Licht, damit jeder ihn sehen kann. Denn wenn ihr umkommt, wird dies die letzte Erinnerung an eure großen Heldentaten bleiben.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13244,'de','Haltet diesen Schild stolz ins Licht, damit jeder ihn sehen kann. Denn wenn ihr umkommt, wird dies die letzte Erinnerung an eure großen Heldentaten bleiben.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13245,'de','Haltet diesen Schild stolz ins Licht, damit jeder ihn sehen kann. Denn wenn ihr umkommt, wird dies die letzte Erinnerung an eure großen Heldentaten bleiben.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13246,'de','This headgear is a tribute to the warrior Georgie Endicott-Zeta, or GG EZ for short. He was always a serious player, never shying away from a challenge, until one day he took a beating from a complete stranger, which caused him to have a meltdown. When you wear it, you''ll be compelled to shout his name every time you win.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13247,'de','This cape absorbs your defeated enemies'' salty tears. The more they whinge, the more their bitterness will be absorbed, making it ever more radiant.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13248,'de','No matter how frustrated you get, this staff won''t shatter. Even after being slammed against a wall when you lose against some nobody.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13249,'de','Forged for those who swear fealty to virtual kingdoms, this shield protects the wearer from that utmost threat: grass (and the touching thereof).');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13250,'de','This pet is the only living thing able to withstand our smell, not even flinching at odours which others would flee from. Admittedly, after engaging in combat for days without bothering to bathe, it''s hard to say if it tolerates our smell... or is simply contributing to it.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13253,'de','Diese vertraut aussehende Umhang wurde von Hel Münster in Person verzaubert, nachdem ihn ein berühmter Schneider von Astrub inständig darum gebeten hatte. Er wollte eine Kollektion anfertigen, die sich an die Farben des Trägers anpasste. Trotz eines streng geheimen Bleichverfahrens ist euch der typische Geruch des Sabbers von WuWulf nicht entgangen ... Igitt!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13260,'de','This shield proudly bears the Mercenary Clan''s emblem, and the two wings on the back make it look so majestic... but they won''t help you dodge attacks.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13261,'de','Over the course of missions completed, this cloak will evolve, a witness to the wearer''s prestige and their loyalty to the Mercenary Clan.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13262,'de','The Veteran has traversed battlefields, dodged blades and survived countless battles. Now he no longer fights. He remains by your side, prepared to grunt and show his teeth if need be.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13263,'de','This headgear will grant you great powers of persuasion. Everyone you talk to will find themselves unable to refuse anything you ask, even a treat or a cuddle.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13264,'de','Mum and her whole brood are out and about! It''s a veritable symphony of babbling, singing, tweeting and chirping. Woe be to those who try to clip their wings... One peck isn''t so bad, but four at a time will start to do some real damage...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13265,'de','They say that the Sinistro frozen in this shield stopped working, thus stopping the passage of time along with it. As if stopping this metronome from ticking would have the power to freeze time. A heresy that most any Xelor will advise you to reject.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13266,'de','The paradoxical thing about this pet is that it''s creation was inspired by the future. But when the model is only invented years after the copy that was used to create the original, who can say which one is authentic? And that sums up Paradoxine in a nutshell.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13267,'de','This machine in the form of an owl seems to be linked to the power of the Eliacube, unless it''s the Eliacube itself...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13268,'de','This mysterious portal seems to be connected to another dimension. While it''s very handy for causing any projectiles fired your way to disappear without a trace, be careful not to step on it by mistake – no one knows where it leads...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13269,'de','This cape seems to be made not of cloth, but of the very fabric from which the dimensions are woven.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13270,'de','This dazzling mask could make you a beacon in the night, or a destroyer of worlds.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13271,'de','This young dragon may look cute now, but wait until you see its adult form.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13272,'de','This little dragon still attached to its egg is a perfect defence against anyone who gets too close.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13273,'de','This dragonskin cape will protect you from blasts of flame, but not from your own bad karma.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13274,'de','With this draconic helmet, your enemies will look death in the eye while you see the world through rose-coloured glasses.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13275,'de','The thick block of ice around this piwi protects it from the wintery cold of Frigost.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13276,'de','If you''re ever caught in a snowstorm, hold this shield in front of your face. It will keep the snow and wind out of your eyes, and even light the path ahead of you. It doesn''t tell time, however.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13277,'de','When you live in Frigost, it''s best to dress for the weather. This comfortable Mastogob-hair cape will be your strongest ally against the island''s icy winds.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13278,'de','With this thick hood on your head, you definitely won''t catch cold. Just make sure you don''t get caught by the Count''s servants, as that''ll probably be a lot harder to recover from.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13279,'de','If you''re a little bit mad but are still able to keep a cool head, this helmet is for you.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13280,'de','As the proud owner of a chtigredon with the warmest, silkiest fur he''d ever seen, Harebourg quickly realised that his pet was shedding a ridiculous amount of hair. He pragmatically decided to make it into capes for the harsh Frigostian winter.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13282,'de','This imposing club smells strongly of cawwot, a sign that it was in the Wa Wabbit''s Warren for a long time. Although fearsome in combat, it''s mainly used as a doorstop for the Wa Wabbit.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13283,'de','A Boon just for you?! Who would''ve thought this fluffy companion could ever be yours? This four-legged stuffed toy is adorable from every angle, but it''s also a huge ally. During the day, it''ll disorientate your enemies, gaining their sympathy with but a look; at night, it''ll comfort you after a long day, letting you nuzzle against its soft fur.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13284,'de','When you''re armed with this bulwark, no invader can get into the city of Brutas! Still... you do realise shields can''t do everything, right...?');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13285,'de','Forged in the purest tradition of mercenary artisans, this helmet is equal parts distinctive and dangerous.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13286,'de','As unmistakeable as a banner, this cloak shows everyone that all of Astrub is behind you!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13287,'de','The future is assured with this guard that''s the size of a key ring! Don''t underestimate him, though. He could pull the rug out from under you.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13288,'de','None would dare cross swords with anyone wearing this war cloak. Except maybe a greedy Sram, who sees kamas when he looks at your outfit... Accursed thieves and assassins! The scoundrels always attack from behind!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13289,'de','Like a mysterious spirit, loyal to their glorious city, you''ll go unrecognised by everyone – even your mother – when you wear this fantastic helmet with a flaming crest! Hopefully you can see out of it yourself...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13290,'de','From this view, you might think it''s worth its weight in kamas. But that''s not what really makes this shield special; more importantly, it''s a torch passed between noble warriors who are loyal to one city, and only one city... Amakna!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13291,'de','This little tank on legs isn''t the kind to get pushed around. If you want to get by it, you''ll have to go through it...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13292,'de','Most pets are cute enough to eat, but for this one, that could easily be fatal! Note that he''s also quite sensitive to the sun...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13293,'de','This shield gives new meaning to the expression "raising the bar". Watch out, your opponents may develop a taste for it...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13294,'de','Ta-DAM! We''ve whipped up a Coco Headgear.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13295,'de','Designed by the greatest chocolate crafters in the World of Twelve, this cloak is a genuine work of art, and completely immune to chocolate stains. But not to bite marks!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13300,'de','The downside of having nine lives is that you have to go through early childhood every time you''re reincarnated. This Kerubaby may seem a bit grumpy at times, but try to understand – this is the ninth time he''s tried to stop using his dummy, and he still can''t do it!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13301,'de','The Ankaffiliate Necklace is a gift for the Krosmoz universe''s most loyal followers. It grants the wearer a pass which can be used to open any door connected with the Ankamaverse, without exception.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13304,'de','When you''re feeling sad, it knows how to comfort you. The small Elante is simply irresistible.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13306,'de','The Lilboss is an ancient, multi-talented creature that carries a feather for each feat it''s achieved over the years. Its wisdom may rub off on you, but from its point of view, YOU are the cute pet coming along on its adventures!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13307,'de','The ever-practical old boss crafted his ritual symbol using a solid slab of stone that could be used as a shield. It''s a useful item in war as well as during official ceremonies! Though we do recommend cleaning it in between.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13308,'de','They say the old boss once managed to hit two birds with a single arrow, and blindfolded. This traditional headgear honours the legend, with two feathers representing the birds and a piece of fabric that prevents you from seeing a thing. Happy hunting!');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13309,'de','What can''t you use this cloak as? A blanket, a raincoat, a flag, a doormat... The old boss was ingenious, but he also had a sense of style. Honour his memory by finding a new use for this cloak! Or you can always wear it on your shoulders...');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13346,'de','Ce petit dragogindonneau rêve de fêter nowel, encore faut-il qu''il ne se fasse pas rôtir pendant la Fête de Fanks Guivingue.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13349,'de','Diese Axt mit ungewöhnlicher Form verfügt über eine vibrierende Klinge, mit der man seine Gegner musikalisch erledigen kann.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13350,'de','Au tréfonds des terres, ce phorreur amalgamé avec cette pierre rare qu''on appelle Bismuth fore à foison. Doué d''un sens aigu de l''orientation, c''est sans effort qu''il se repère dans les tranchées labyrinthiques ; une qualité inestimable quand on veut traverser un dédale, mais qui n''est pourtant rien comparée à sa bonté.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13352,'de','When created, this shield was placed under a powerful spell intended to exponentially increase the oratory talents of whoever carries it. However, a slight grammatical mistake in the incantation of the spell means that its power is only activated when it is used to create chaos. In short, it''s the perfect shield for family gatherings');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(13353,'de','When you set these glasses on your nose, it''s like seeing life through a filter. You''ll start pouting like the famous Bella Porch and you''ll feel a sudden urge to dance to intoxicating sounds. If you look around you, everyone else seems to be caught up in the same mania. Don''t wear them for too long or you may become disconnected from reality.');
INSERT INTO "item_descriptions" VALUES(20098,'de','As a proper Shushu, Budshu will make trouble for you. Even more so for your acolyte Goultard! He''ll throw stones at him till he bends the knee to Rushu... You can always give him some chow to increase his stats (and calm him down).');
CREATE TABLE item_drops (item INTEGER, monster_ankama_id INTEGER, rate REAL, conditions TEXT);
